{const c={"id":"completion-select-v22","sceneId":"co1","title":"完井方式智能优选：交互式学习实验","status":"ready","version":"2.2.0","updated":"2026-11-02","tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","lede":"完井方式决定井筒与储层的连通方式。裸眼、套管射孔、筛管和砾石充填在防砂、复杂程度和流动能力方面存在取舍，不能仅按单一产能指标选型。","judge":[{"label":"方法","value":"案例推理 + 防砂知识规则排序","desc":"纯前端实际计算"},{"label":"数据","value":"教学合成","desc":"独立训练与测试"},{"label":"输出","value":"四种方式排序及相似案例引用","desc":"可视化与 CSV"},{"label":"范围","value":"教学演示","desc":"是微型案例库与规则融合，不是完整知识图谱；评分无真实经济含义。"}],"sections":[{"no":1,"en":"CONCEPT","title":"专业概念与背景","html":"<figure style=\"margin:0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 180\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"完井专业概念\"><g font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#345647\"><text x=\"20\" y=\"45\">储层条件</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"100\">出砂 / 出水</text><text x=\"230\" y=\"45\">防砂知识规则</text><text x=\"230\" y=\"100\">历史案例 H001…H080</text><text x=\"520\" y=\"70\">四种方式排序</text><text x=\"520\" y=\"130\">证据编号可追溯</text></g><path d=\"M135 65H215M425 65H500\" stroke=\"#43836b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/></svg><figcaption>原理示意，不代表现场结构、产能或力学验算。</figcaption></figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"完井方式智能优选概念\"><rect width=\"760\" height=\"170\" fill=\"#eef4e9\"/><path d=\"M20 130L60 120L100 125L140 60L180 65L220 80L260 40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#43836b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#345648\">完井方式智能优选</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"155\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#345648\">地层条件 → 近邻案例检索 → 防砂规则 → 候选排序</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#345648\">储层 / 温压 / 生产状态 → 建模与决策 → 可复核候选</text></svg><p>概念示意，非现场曲线。具体坐标和单位见案例演示。</p><p>完井方式决定井筒与储层的连通方式。裸眼、套管射孔、筛管和砾石充填在防砂、复杂程度和流动能力方面存在取舍，不能仅按单一产能指标选型。</p>"},{"no":2,"en":"AI","title":"方法与介入点","html":"<p>输入：出砂倾向与出水代理、带来源编号的历史案例。方法：案例推理 + 防砂知识规则排序。输出：四种方式排序及相似案例引用。</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px\"><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>01</b><p>规范条件与案例</p><small>输入与标签</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>02</b><p>每方案检索三个近邻</p><small>模型与特征</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>03</b><p>融合规则评分</p><small>预测与决策</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>04</b><p>引用证据并人工复核</p><small>误差与来源</small></div></div><p>地层条件 → 近邻案例检索 → 防砂规则 → 候选排序。</p>"},{"no":3,"en":"DATA","title":"数据要求与验证","html":"<p>真实应用需要同井段配对的出砂倾向与出水代理、带来源编号的历史案例，并由施工结果、胶结解释或独立验证资料提供标签。先做小规模概念验证，再按井、样品或连续时间块留出测试，避免相邻样本泄漏。</p><p>本演示训练种子 17、测试初始种子 91；代理从独立合成样本拟合；优选采用案例推理与规则；滑套采用表格强化学习。所有样本均为教学合成。</p>"},{"no":4,"en":"LIMIT","title":"局限与参考","html":"<p>是微型案例库与规则融合，不是完整知识图谱；评分无真实经济含义。</p><p><a href=\"https://glossary.slb.com/en/terms/c/completion_bond_log\">SLB：防砂完井概念</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.neighbors.NearestCentroid.html\">最近类中心原理</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/linear_model.html\">回归与逻辑回归原理</a>。合成公式与示范为本项目独立教学实现。</p>"}]},"workflow":{"label":"案例流程","title":"完井方式智能优选：输入到验收","lead":["每一步均对应演示里的计算或证据。调节滑块观察成像、噪声、平滑或审核阈值的影响。"],"stats":[["运行","浏览器"],["数据","合成"],["输出","可导出"]],"steps":[{"name":"01 规范条件与案例","role":"数据","do":"出砂倾向与出水代理、带来源编号的历史案例按深度对齐，按独立井留出测试。","effect":"规范输入及标签","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"02 每方案检索三个近邻","role":"学习","do":"按各例方法建立案例检索、回归代理或 Q 表；不使用测试标签拟合。","effect":"可复用的训练模型","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"03 融合规则评分","role":"推理","do":"地层条件 → 近邻案例检索 → 防砂规则 → 候选排序；第一滑块调节当前实验参数。","effect":"可视预测与候选","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"04 引用证据并人工复核","role":"验收","do":"比较真值与基线，导出 CSV 并复核误差。","effect":"基线比较或来源审核","trap":"是微型案例库与规则融合，不是完整知识图谱；评分无真实经济含义。"}],"metrics":{"title":"步骤映射与评价口径","html":"<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px\"><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>01</b><p>规范条件与案例</p><small>输入与标签</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>02</b><p>每方案检索三个近邻</p><small>模型与特征</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>03</b><p>融合规则评分</p><small>预测与决策</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>04</b><p>引用证据并人工复核</p><small>误差与来源</small></div></div><p>分类准确率 = 正确数 / 测试数；F1 = 2TP/(2TP+FP+FN)。层界按 ±2 m 一对一匹配；报告引用覆盖率仅表示有来源，不等于语义正确率。后验分数未经校准。</p><p>排序需检查相似案例编号与知识规则；本例没有现场方案真值，不报告选型准确率。</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 105\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"数据到决策与验收\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">独立资料</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"192\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">学习模型</text><rect x=\"360\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">候选 / 预测</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"552\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">误差与约束复核</text></svg>"},"fails":[{"name":"采集与工况变化","why":"井况、浆体与地层压力变化可影响结果。"},{"name":"标签与对齐","why":"深度归位、采样尺度与人工解释歧义可能影响真值。"},{"name":"边界","why":"是微型案例库与规则融合，不是完整知识图谱；评分无真实经济含义。"}]},"demo":{"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850}}},demo={"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850},files=[{"name":"demo/index.html","size":2989,"enc":"text","data":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>完井方式智能优选</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"demo.css\"></head><body><div class=\"panel\"><header class=\"demo-head\"><div><span class=\"kicker\">独立合成测试井 · 种子 <span id=\"seed\"></span></span><h1>完井方式智能优选</h1><p class=\"lead\">完井方式决定井筒与储层的连通方式。裸眼、套管射孔、筛管和砾石充填在防砂、复杂程度和流动能力方面存在取舍，不能仅按单一产能指标选型。</p></div><button id=\"new\" class=\"btn primary\">换一口井 ↻</button></header><div class=\"demo-controls\"><div class=\"ctl\"><label>出砂倾向 ×100 <output id=\"pv\"></output></label><input id=\"param\" aria-label=\"出砂倾向 ×100\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"50\" step=\"1\"></div><div class=\"ctl\"><label>出水基础代理 <output id=\"nv\"></output></label><input id=\"noise\" aria-label=\"噪声\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"20\"></div></div><div class=\"demo-body\"><section class=\"demo-charts charts\"><div class=\"legend\">橙：阈值/真值/推荐；绿：学习/策略；蓝：基线。各图按标注单位读取。</div><figure><figcaption>四种完井方式的案例与规则评分</figcaption><canvas id=\"a\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"四种完井方式的案例与规则评分\"></canvas></figure><figure><figcaption>当前测试井的出砂与出水代理条件</figcaption><canvas id=\"b\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"当前测试井的出砂与出水代理条件\"></canvas></figure><svg id=\"diagnostic\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"逐点误差分析\"></svg></section><aside class=\"demo-results\"><div id=\"metrics\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><p class=\"note\" id=\"explain\"></p><section class=\"inspect\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>逐点核对：计算结果与依据</h2><span id=\"position\"></span></div><label class=\"point-control\">选择位置<input id=\"point\" aria-label=\"核对位置\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"89\" value=\"25\"></label><div id=\"point-values\" class=\"point-values\"></div><p id=\"point-explain\"></p></section><details><summary>展开模型系数与结果明细</summary><pre id=\"report\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:12px/1.9 sans-serif;max-height:280px;overflow:auto;background:#f8f6ef;padding:10px\"></pre><p>案例推理 + 防砂知识规则排序；训练/优化依据见实际模型明细，换井不重新训练。</p><p id=\"coeff\" class=\"coeff\"></p><div id=\"details\"></div></details><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"run\">重新计算</button><button id=\"reset\">恢复默认</button><button id=\"csv\">导出本次 CSV</button></div><p class=\"note\">是微型案例库与规则融合，不是完整知识图谱；评分无真实经济含义。 全部数据为合成教学资料，结果需要独立井验证和人工复核。</p></aside></div></div><script src=\"demo.js\"></script></body></html>","mime":"text/html"},{"name":"demo/demo.css","size":7919,"enc":"text","data":"/* 示范页样式。运行在沙箱 iframe 里，随便写，不影响主站。 */\n:root{\n  --ink:#242b2e; --ink-2:#4d565b; --ink-3:#79828a;\n  --line:#e9e4d8; --jade:#2f7d6b; --jade-l:#e6f1ec;\n  --clay:#b26a39; --paper:#fbfaf6;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{\n  margin:0;padding:18px 20px 24px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:\"Inter\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;\n}\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}\nh1{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.78}\n.ctl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:9px}\n.ctl label{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-width:170px}\n.ctl output{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}\n.ctl input[type=range]{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade);height:18px}\nsvg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff}\n#ratio{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}\n.readouts{\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;\n  background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\n  margin-top:12px;\n}\n.ro{background:#fff;padding:9px 12px}\n.ro .k{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.06em}\n.ro b{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.ro b.ok{color:var(--jade)}\n.ro b.bad{color:var(--clay)}\n.note{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);line-height:1.75}\n.note b{color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* 保持样例底色、字号、控件和读数样式；增加逐点解释。 */\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:10.5px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--ink-2)}.dot:before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:5px}.truth:before{background:#2f7d6b}.model:before{background:#b26a39}.base:before{background:#41699b}.mud{background:#f4f7eb;padding:0 4px}#porosity,#residual{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}.inspect,details{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.section-head span{font-family:monospace;color:var(--jade)}.point-control{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:10px 0;font-size:12px}.point-control input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade)}.point-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.point-values div{padding:8px;background:#fff}.point-values span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}.point-values b{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace}#point-explain{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}details{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.actions button{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:5px;font:12px inherit;color:var(--jade);cursor:pointer}.actions span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:12px}.ctl{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px}.ctl label{min-width:100%}.readouts,.point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.section-head{display:block}}\n\n/* 与老师 welllog-layer 样例一致：标题说明右侧、参数条上方。 */\n.demo-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#f6f5ee}.demo-head>div{flex:1;min-width:220px}.demo-head .lead{margin-bottom:0}.kicker{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--jade)}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:7px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.btn.primary{background:var(--jade);border-color:var(--jade);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.btn.primary:hover{background:#256554;border-color:#256554}.btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--clay);outline-offset:3px}\n\n/* v2.2: fill the portal's full content width; match the reference's header/body structure. */\nbody{padding:0;background:var(--paper)}\n.panel{width:100%;max-width:none;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}\n.demo-head{margin:0;padding:14px 18px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;background:#fcfbf8;gap:18px}\n.demo-head>div{min-width:220px;flex:1}.demo-head h1{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px}.demo-head .lead{max-width:86ch;font-size:11.8px;line-height:1.7}\n.demo-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:14px 24px;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8f6f0}\n.demo-controls .ctl{flex:0 1 340px;margin:0;gap:12px;min-width:250px}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:135px;font-size:11.5px}.demo-controls .ctl input{min-width:90px;width:150px}\n.demo-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(320px,.9fr);align-items:start}\n.demo-charts{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}\n.demo-results{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px}.demo-charts .legend{margin:0 0 9px;gap:8px 12px}\n.demo-charts svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.demo-results .readouts{margin-top:0;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.demo-results .ro{padding:10px 12px}.demo-results .ro b{font-size:14px}.demo-results .note{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.8}\n.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values div{padding:9px 10px}\n.demo-results .section-head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.demo-results .section-head h2{font-size:12.5px}.demo-results .actions{gap:8px}.demo-results .actions span{flex-basis:100%}\n.demo-results .actions button{font-family:inherit;font-size:12px}.demo-results details{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.demo-results table{table-layout:fixed}button,input{touch-action:manipulation}\n@media(max-width:960px){.demo-body{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.demo-charts{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.demo-results .readouts{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:0}.panel{border-radius:9px}.demo-head,.demo-controls,.demo-charts,.demo-results{padding:12px}.demo-controls{gap:10px}.demo-controls .ctl{flex:1 1 100%;min-width:0;flex-wrap:nowrap}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:130px}.demo-results .readouts,.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-head h1{font-size:16px}.demo-head .btn{margin-left:auto}}\n\n.charts figure{margin:0 0 12px}.charts figcaption{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:6px}.charts canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;cursor:crosshair}#metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--line)}#metrics div{background:white;padding:10px}#metrics span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}#metrics strong{font:14px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--jade)}#details{overflow:auto}#details table{table-layout:auto;font-size:10px}.point-values b{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.point-values div{min-width:0}#diagnostic{margin-top:10px}.coeff{font-size:11px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}","mime":"text/css"},{"name":"demo/demo.js","size":14193,"enc":"text","data":"(function(){const TYPE=\"select\",SPEC={\"unit\":\"\",\"value\":50,\"inspect\":\"每行对应一种完井方式，source_case_ids列出三个实际检索的合成历史案例编号。评分是案例均值与知识规则惩罚的组合，无经济单位，需结合真实井况复核。\",\"classes\":[\"详见图内单位和说明\"]};\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id),clamp=(v,a,b)=>Math.max(a,Math.min(b,v));function rng(s){return()=>{s=(Math.imul(1664525,s)+1013904223)>>>0;return s/4294967296}}\nlet seed=91,rows=[],head=[],frame=0;\nfunction fit(data){let n=data[0].x.length,A=Array.from({length:n},()=>Array(n+1).fill(0));for(const {x,y} of data)for(let i=0;i<n;i++){for(let j=0;j<n;j++)A[i][j]+=x[i]*x[j];A[i][n]+=x[i]*y}for(let i=1;i<n;i++)A[i][i]+=.01;for(let i=0;i<n;i++){let p=i;for(let j=i+1;j<n;j++)if(Math.abs(A[j][i])>Math.abs(A[p][i]))p=j;[A[i],A[p]]=[A[p],A[i]];let v=A[i][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[i][j]/=v;for(let z=0;z<n;z++)if(z!==i){let q=A[z][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[z][j]-=q*A[i][j]}}return A.map(row=>row[n])}\nconst predict=(w,x)=>w.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+v*x[i],0),mae=(a,b)=>a.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-b[i]),0)/a.length;\nfunction chart(id,series,min,max,xlabel,ylabel,bands=[]){let c=$(id),g=c.getContext('2d'),w=640,h=340;g.clearRect(0,0,w,h);const px=i=>55+i/Math.max(1,series[0].values.length-1)*560,py=v=>285-(v-min)/(max-min)*240;\n bands.forEach(b=>{g.fillStyle=b.color;g.fillRect(px(b.start),45,px(b.end)-px(b.start),240)});\n g.font='12px sans-serif';g.lineWidth=1;for(let i=0;i<=4;i++){let v=min+(max-min)*i/4,y=py(v);g.strokeStyle='#dce5df';g.beginPath();g.moveTo(55,y);g.lineTo(615,y);g.stroke();g.fillStyle='#4b6259';g.fillText(v.toFixed(max-min<1?2:max<=3?1:0),4,y+4)}g.fillText(ylabel,55,22);g.fillText(xlabel,215,333);for(let i=0;i<=4;i++)g.fillText(Math.round(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4),px(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4)-5,306);\n series.forEach(s=>{g.strokeStyle=s.color;g.lineWidth=2;g.beginPath();s.values.forEach((v,i)=>{i?g.lineTo(px(i),py(v)):g.moveTo(px(i),py(v))});g.stroke()});}\nconst model=(()=>{let r=rng(17),data=[];if(TYPE==='select'){return Array.from({length:80},(_,i)=>{let sand=r(),water=r(),method=i%4;return {id:'H'+String(i+1).padStart(3,'0'),x:[sand,water],method,y:85-25*sand*(1-[.05,.15,.65,.9][method])-12*water-8*method+(r()-.5)*4}})}if(TYPE==='valve'){let q=Array.from({length:10},()=>[0,0,0]);for(let episode=0;episode<1600;episode++){let state=Math.floor(r()*9);for(let t=0;t<20;t++){let action=r()<.2?Math.floor(r()*3):q[state].indexOf(Math.max(...q[state])),water=state/9,open=[1,.6,.2][action],reward=100*open*(1-water)-100*open*water*.7,next=clamp(state+(action===0?1:action===1?(r()<.5?1:0):0),0,9);q[state][action]+=.15*(reward+.92*Math.max(...q[next])-q[state][action]);state=next}}return q}let a=[],b=[];for(let i=0;i<500;i++){let x=r(),y=r(),z=r(),features=TYPE==='perforate'?[1,x,y,z,x*y]:[1,x,y,x*y];a.push({x:features,y:TYPE==='perforate'?40+30*x+20*y+8*z+10*x*y:60+110*x+70*y+25*x*y});if(TYPE==='perforate')b.push({x:features,y:5+20*x+12*y+4*z+6*x*y})}return {primary:fit(a),risk:b.length?fit(b):null}})();\nfunction metrics(a){$('metrics').innerHTML=a.map(([a,b])=>'<div><span>'+a+'</span><strong>'+b+'</strong></div>').join('')}\nfunction run(){let p=+$('param').value,noise=+$('noise').value/100,r=rng(seed);$('pv').value=p;$('nv').value=noise.toFixed(2);$('seed').textContent=seed;$('report').textContent='';rows=[];\nif(TYPE==='select'){let sand=p/100,water=clamp(noise+((seed-91)%17)*.015,0,1),names=['裸眼','套管射孔','筛管','砾石充填'],scores=[],support=[];for(let m=0;m<4;m++){let near=model.filter(d=>d.method===m).map(d=>({...d,dist:(d.x[0]-sand)**2+(d.x[1]-water)**2})).sort((a,b)=>a.dist-b.dist).slice(0,3),estimate=near.reduce((s,d)=>s+d.y,0)/3,penalty=35*sand*(1-[.05,.15,.65,.9][m]),score=estimate-penalty;scores.push(score);support.push(near.map(d=>d.id).join('/'))}let best=scores.indexOf(Math.max(...scores));chart('a',[{values:scores,color:'#43836b'}],0,100,'方案编号 0裸眼 / 1射孔 / 2筛管 / 3砾石充填','相似案例效益 − 出砂惩罚 / 教学分数');chart('b',[{values:[sand,water],color:'#c59048'}],0,1,'特征编号 0出砂倾向 / 1出水代理','输入特征（0–1）');metrics([['候选首位',names[best]],['最高教学评分',scores[best].toFixed(1)],['历史合成案例','80 条'],['每方案引用','3 条近邻']]);$('explain').textContent='以出砂和出水代理的欧氏距离检索每种方式最近的三个历史合成案例，均值效益减去手工知识规则的防砂不足惩罚后排序。该实现为案例推理与规则融合，不是训练好的知识图谱或产能模型。第一滑块为出砂倾向，第二滑块为出水基础代理；换井叠加固定井间差异，实际值见右图。评分无货币单位，不等于真实收益，不能据此直接选现场方案。';$('report').textContent=names.map((n,i)=>n+'：引用 '+support[i]+'，评分 '+scores[i].toFixed(2)).join('\\n');head=['method','score','source_case_ids'];rows=names.map((v,i)=>[v,scores[i],support[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='perforate'){let candidates=[];for(let density of [8,12,16,20])for(let depth of [.2,.4,.6,.8])for(let phase of [60,90,120]){let x=(density-8)/12,y=(depth-.2)/.6,z=(phase-60)/60,features=[1,x,y,z,x*y],production=predict(model.primary,features),risk=predict(model.risk,features)+noise*8+((seed-91)%17)*.12;candidates.push({density,depth,phase,production,risk})}let front=candidates.filter(a=>!candidates.some(b=>b.production>=a.production&&b.risk<=a.risk&&(b.production>a.production||b.risk<a.risk))),feasible=front.filter(c=>c.risk<=p),best=feasible.sort((a,b)=>b.production-a.production)[0];chart('a',[{values:candidates.map(c=>c.production),color:'#43836b'}],30,120,'候选组合编号（48 组）','预测产能指数 / 无量纲');chart('b',[{values:candidates.map(c=>c.risk),color:'#43836b'},{values:candidates.map(()=>p),color:'#c59048'}],0,70,'候选组合编号','出砂代价指数 / 教学分数');drawPareto(candidates,front,best,p);metrics([['帕累托候选',front.length+' / 48'],['约束内前沿点',feasible.length],['推荐孔密',best?best.density+' 孔/m':'无可行方案'],['推荐穿深 / 相位',best?best.depth+' m / '+best.phase+'°':'—']]);$('explain').textContent='500 个独立合成训练组合分别拟合产能和出砂代价代理；枚举孔密、穿深、相位共 48 组，剔除被其他方案同时“更高产能、更低代价”支配的点，形成帕累托前沿。第一滑块为允许代价上限，第二滑块增加代价裕度，换井叠加固定的井间代价差异。前沿内筛选最高预测产能，无可行点时返回无解。代价不是概率；未做射孔弹、岩石力学或真实产能计算。';$('report').textContent='帕累托前沿组合：\\n'+front.map(c=>c.density+'孔/m，'+c.depth+'m，'+c.phase+'°，产能指数'+c.production.toFixed(1)+'，代价'+c.risk.toFixed(1)).join('\\n');head=['density_shots_m','penetration_m','phase_deg','productivity_index','sand_cost_index','pareto','selected'];rows=candidates.map(c=>[c.density,c.depth,c.phase,c.production,c.risk,front.includes(c)?1:0,c===best?1:0]);}\nif(TYPE==='stress'){let truth=[],pred=[],base=[],factors=[];for(let i=0;i<100;i++){let t=p/100,pressure=.5+.4*Math.sin((i+seed%19)/16),y=60+110*t+70*pressure+25*t*pressure,observed=clamp(t+(r()-.5)*noise,0,1);truth.push(y);pred.push(predict(model.primary,[1,observed,pressure,observed*pressure]));base.push(180);factors.push(300/Math.max(1,pred[i]))}chart('a',[{values:truth,color:'#c59048'},{values:pred,color:'#43836b'},{values:base,color:'#648eae'}],0,300,'工况组合序号（压力代理随序号变化）','等效载荷代理 / MPa');chart('b',[{values:factors,color:'#43836b'},{values:factors.map(()=>1.5),color:'#c59048'}],0,6,'工况组合序号','教学强度限值 / 预测载荷');metrics([['预测 MAE',(pred.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-truth[i]),0)/100).toFixed(2)+' MPa'],['固定基线 MAE',(base.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-truth[i]),0)/100).toFixed(2)+' MPa'],['最小代理安全系数',Math.min(...factors).toFixed(2)],['低于教学目标工况',factors.filter(v=>v<1.5).length+' / 100']]);$('explain').textContent='500 个合成温压工况训练含交互项的岭回归，预测等效载荷代理。第一滑块为归一化温差×100，第二滑块为温度观测噪声。橙：真值；绿：代理；蓝：固定 180 MPa。300 MPa 强度和 1.5 目标均为教学假设，不对应钢级规范；未实现轴力、弯曲、屈曲、接头泄漏或疲劳验算。';head=['scenario','truth_load_MPa','predicted_load_MPa','fixed_load_MPa','proxy_safety_factor'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,v,pred[i],base[i],factors[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='valve'){let policy=[],baseline=[],waterCurve=[],states=[],actions=[],s=1+seed%3,b=1+seed%3,total=0,totalBase=0;for(let t=0;t<60;t++){let sensed=clamp(Math.round(s+(r()-.5)*noise*4),0,9),cost=p/100,a=model[sensed].indexOf(Math.max(...model[sensed])),op=[1,.6,.2][a],w=s/9,wb=b/9,reward=100*op*(1-w)-100*op*w*cost,rb=100*(1-wb)-100*wb*cost;total+=reward;totalBase+=rb;policy.push(total);baseline.push(totalBase);waterCurve.push(w);states.push(s);actions.push(op);s=clamp(s+(a===0?1:a===1?(r()<.5?1:0):0),0,9);b=clamp(b+1,0,9)}chart('a',[{values:policy,color:'#43836b'},{values:baseline,color:'#648eae'}],-6000,2000,'控制步（每步为一个教学时间单位）','累计净收益 / 无量纲');chart('b',[{values:actions,color:'#43836b'},{values:waterCurve,color:'#c59048'}],0,1.1,'控制步','绿：滑套开度 / 橙：含水代理');metrics([['Q 策略累计收益',total.toFixed(1)],['全开基线收益',totalBase.toFixed(1)],['训练回合','1600'],['平均开度',(actions.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0)/60).toFixed(2)]]);$('explain').textContent='在十档含水状态、三档开度的简化环境中训练表格 Q-learning（1600 回合）。开度影响产液贡献与含水状态上升。训练水代价固定 0.7，第一滑块改变测试水代价，展示目标迁移时的表现；第二滑块模拟状态观测误差。策略训练后固定，与全开策略从相同初始状态比较，各自按动作演化。该例只控制单个等效区段，不模拟多段干扰、真实储层或累计产油体积。';head=['step','state','opening','water_proxy','Q_policy_cumulative_reward','all_open_cumulative_reward'];rows=policy.map((v,i)=>[i,states[i],actions[i],waterCurve[i],v,baseline[i]]);}\n$('details').innerHTML='<table><tr>'+head.map(v=>'<th>'+v+'</th>').join('')+'</tr>'+rows.slice(0,5).map(row=>'<tr>'+row.map(v=>'<td>'+(typeof v==='number'?v.toFixed(3):v)+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</table>';\n}\nfunction flush(){if(frame){cancelAnimationFrame(frame);frame=0}run()}function schedule(){$('pv').value=$('param').value;$('nv').value=(+$('noise').value/100).toFixed(2);if(!frame)frame=requestAnimationFrame(()=>{frame=0;run()})}for(const id of ['param','noise']){$(id).oninput=schedule;$(id).onchange=flush}$('run').onclick=flush;$('new').onclick=()=>{seed+=13;flush()};$('csv').onclick=()=>{if(frame)flush();let q=v=>'\"'+String(v).replace(/\"/g,'\"\"')+'\"',blob=new Blob(['\\ufeff'+[head,...rows].map(row=>row.map(q).join(',')).join('\\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),u=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=u;a.download='completion-'+TYPE+'-'+seed+'.csv';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(u),1000)};\n\nlet selected=0;const rawRun=run;run=function(){rawRun();inspect();diagnostic();$('coeff').textContent=TYPE==='select'?'80条带H编号的独立合成历史案例；每方案按输入距离检索3条，再叠加防砂规则。':TYPE==='valve'?'实际Q表（行=含水状态0至9，列=开度1/0.6/0.2）：'+JSON.stringify(model):'实际学习系数：'+JSON.stringify(model)};\nfunction inspect(){selected=Math.max(0,Math.min(rows.length-1,selected));$('point').max=rows.length-1;$('point').value=selected;$('position').textContent='序号 '+selected;let row=rows[selected];$('point-values').innerHTML=head.map((k,j)=>'<div><span>'+k+'</span><b>'+(typeof row[j]==='number'?row[j].toFixed(4):row[j])+'</b></div>').join('');$('point-explain').textContent=SPEC.inspect;}\nfunction diagnostic(){let a=rows.map((r,i)=>TYPE==='select'?r[1]:TYPE==='perforate'?Math.max(0,r[4]-+$('param').value):TYPE==='stress'?r[2]-r[1]:r[4]-r[5]),max=Math.max(.001,...a.map(Math.abs)),label=TYPE==='select'?'各完井方案最终教学评分（高分优先，不是收益金额）':TYPE==='perforate'?'各候选超出出砂代价上限的缺口（0为满足代价约束）':TYPE==='stress'?'逐工况预测载荷−合成真值 / MPa':'Q策略−全开基线的累计收益差 / 无量纲';$('diagnostic').innerHTML='<text x=\"35\" y=\"16\" fill=\"#79828a\" font-size=\"11\">'+label+'</text><path d=\"M35 85H685\" stroke=\"#ded9cc\"/>'+a.map((v,i)=>'<rect x=\"'+(35+i/a.length*650)+'\" y=\"'+(v>=0?85-v/max*55:85)+'\" width=\"'+Math.max(1,650/a.length-3)+'\" height=\"'+Math.max(.6,Math.abs(v)/max*55)+'\" fill=\"'+(v>=0?'#2f7d6b':'#b26a39')+'\"/>').join('');}\n$('point').addEventListener('input',()=>{selected=+$('point').value;inspect()});$('a').addEventListener('click',ev=>{let r=$('a').getBoundingClientRect(),x=(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width*640;selected=Math.round(Math.max(0,Math.min(1,(x-55)/560))*(rows.length-1));inspect()});$('reset').onclick=()=>{seed=91;$('param').value=SPEC.value;$('noise').value=20;selected=0;flush()};\n\nrun();\n\nfunction drawPareto(all,front,best,limit){let g=$('b').getContext('2d');g.clearRect(0,0,640,340);g.font='12px sans-serif';const px=v=>55+v/70*550,py=v=>285-(v-30)/90*240;g.strokeStyle='#d5dfd3';for(let i=0;i<5;i++){g.beginPath();g.moveTo(55,45+i*60);g.lineTo(610,45+i*60);g.stroke();g.fillStyle='#345647';g.fillText(120-i*22.5,5,45+i*60)}g.strokeStyle='#c59048';g.beginPath();g.moveTo(px(limit),35);g.lineTo(px(limit),290);g.stroke();for(let a of all){g.fillStyle=a===best?'#c59048':front.includes(a)?'#43836b':'#aeb8af';let size=a===best?9:front.includes(a)?6:4;g.fillRect(px(a.risk)-size/2,py(a.production)-size/2,size,size)}g.fillStyle='#345647';g.fillText('产能指数 ↑；绿：帕累托 / 灰：被支配 / 橙：选择与上限',25,20);g.fillText('横轴：出砂代价指数 0 → 70（橙线为允许上限）',100,325)}\r\n\n})();","mime":"text/javascript"}];c.tabs.demo={label:"可运行示范",mount(root){let h=CaseDemoHost.create(root,{files,demo},{scene:ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId],kase:c});return ()=>h.destroy()}};Cases.register(c);ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].demo=true;}
{const c={"id":"completion-perforate-v22","sceneId":"co2","title":"射孔参数智能设计：交互式学习实验","status":"ready","version":"2.2.0","updated":"2026-11-02","tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","lede":"射孔孔道穿过套管与水泥环连通储层。孔密、穿深和相位影响流入通道，设计需平衡产能、出砂和作业条件，不能简单追求更多孔或更深穿透。","judge":[{"label":"方法","value":"双代理岭回归 + 帕累托筛选","desc":"纯前端实际计算"},{"label":"数据","value":"教学合成","desc":"独立训练与测试"},{"label":"输出","value":"帕累托方案与约束内候选","desc":"可视化与 CSV"},{"label":"范围","value":"教学演示","desc":"产能与出砂代价均为合成无量纲指数，未作弹型、应力与真实产能计算。"}],"sections":[{"no":1,"en":"CONCEPT","title":"专业概念与背景","html":"<figure style=\"margin:0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 180\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"完井专业概念\"><path d=\"M40 30V145H220\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#345647\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M60 120L95 88L140 65L200 40\" stroke=\"#43836b\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\"/><g font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#345647\"><text x=\"260\" y=\"45\">帕累托前沿：不能同时改善两个目标</text><text x=\"260\" y=\"90\">提高产能 ↑；降低出砂代价 ←</text><text x=\"260\" y=\"135\">先排除被支配点，再按代价上限筛选</text></g></svg><figcaption>原理示意，不代表现场结构、产能或力学验算。</figcaption></figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"射孔参数智能设计概念\"><rect width=\"760\" height=\"170\" fill=\"#eef4e9\"/><path d=\"M20 130L60 120L100 125L140 60L180 65L220 80L260 40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#43836b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#345648\">射孔参数智能设计</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"155\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#345648\">参数组合 → 双代理 → 非支配前沿 → 约束筛选</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#345648\">储层 / 温压 / 生产状态 → 建模与决策 → 可复核候选</text></svg><p>概念示意，非现场曲线。具体坐标和单位见案例演示。</p><p>射孔孔道穿过套管与水泥环连通储层。孔密、穿深和相位影响流入通道，设计需平衡产能、出砂和作业条件，不能简单追求更多孔或更深穿透。</p>"},{"no":2,"en":"AI","title":"方法与介入点","html":"<p>输入：合成孔密、穿深、相位组合及产能/代价标签。方法：双代理岭回归 + 帕累托筛选。输出：帕累托方案与约束内候选。</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px\"><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>01</b><p>训练集与候选分离</p><small>输入与标签</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>02</b><p>拟合产能和代价代理</p><small>模型与特征</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>03</b><p>提取帕累托前沿</p><small>预测与决策</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>04</b><p>输出可行候选或无解</p><small>误差与来源</small></div></div><p>参数组合 → 双代理 → 非支配前沿 → 约束筛选。</p>"},{"no":3,"en":"DATA","title":"数据要求与验证","html":"<p>真实应用需要同井段配对的合成孔密、穿深、相位组合及产能/代价标签，并由施工结果、胶结解释或独立验证资料提供标签。先做小规模概念验证，再按井、样品或连续时间块留出测试，避免相邻样本泄漏。</p><p>本演示训练种子 17、测试初始种子 91；代理从独立合成样本拟合；优选采用案例推理与规则；滑套采用表格强化学习。所有样本均为教学合成。</p>"},{"no":4,"en":"LIMIT","title":"局限与参考","html":"<p>产能与出砂代价均为合成无量纲指数，未作弹型、应力与真实产能计算。</p><p><a href=\"https://glossary.slb.com/en/terms/c/completion_bond_log\">SLB：防砂完井概念</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.neighbors.NearestCentroid.html\">最近类中心原理</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/linear_model.html\">回归与逻辑回归原理</a>。合成公式与示范为本项目独立教学实现。</p>"}]},"workflow":{"label":"案例流程","title":"射孔参数智能设计：输入到验收","lead":["每一步均对应演示里的计算或证据。调节滑块观察成像、噪声、平滑或审核阈值的影响。"],"stats":[["运行","浏览器"],["数据","合成"],["输出","可导出"]],"steps":[{"name":"01 训练集与候选分离","role":"数据","do":"合成孔密、穿深、相位组合及产能/代价标签按深度对齐，按独立井留出测试。","effect":"规范输入及标签","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"02 拟合产能和代价代理","role":"学习","do":"按各例方法建立案例检索、回归代理或 Q 表；不使用测试标签拟合。","effect":"可复用的训练模型","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"03 提取帕累托前沿","role":"推理","do":"参数组合 → 双代理 → 非支配前沿 → 约束筛选；第一滑块调节当前实验参数。","effect":"可视预测与候选","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"04 输出可行候选或无解","role":"验收","do":"比较真值与基线，导出 CSV 并复核误差。","effect":"基线比较或来源审核","trap":"产能与出砂代价均为合成无量纲指数，未作弹型、应力与真实产能计算。"}],"metrics":{"title":"步骤映射与评价口径","html":"<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px\"><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>01</b><p>训练集与候选分离</p><small>输入与标签</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>02</b><p>拟合产能和代价代理</p><small>模型与特征</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>03</b><p>提取帕累托前沿</p><small>预测与决策</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>04</b><p>输出可行候选或无解</p><small>误差与来源</small></div></div><p>分类准确率 = 正确数 / 测试数；F1 = 2TP/(2TP+FP+FN)。层界按 ±2 m 一对一匹配；报告引用覆盖率仅表示有来源，不等于语义正确率。后验分数未经校准。</p><p>帕累托判据：产能不低且代价不高，至少一个严格更优；只有未被支配点进入前沿。</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 105\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"数据到决策与验收\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">独立资料</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"192\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">学习模型</text><rect x=\"360\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">候选 / 预测</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"552\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">误差与约束复核</text></svg>"},"fails":[{"name":"采集与工况变化","why":"井况、浆体与地层压力变化可影响结果。"},{"name":"标签与对齐","why":"深度归位、采样尺度与人工解释歧义可能影响真值。"},{"name":"边界","why":"产能与出砂代价均为合成无量纲指数，未作弹型、应力与真实产能计算。"}]},"demo":{"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850}}},demo={"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850},files=[{"name":"demo/index.html","size":3034,"enc":"text","data":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>射孔参数智能设计</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"demo.css\"></head><body><div class=\"panel\"><header class=\"demo-head\"><div><span class=\"kicker\">独立合成测试井 · 种子 <span id=\"seed\"></span></span><h1>射孔参数智能设计</h1><p class=\"lead\">射孔孔道穿过套管与水泥环连通储层。孔密、穿深和相位影响流入通道，设计需平衡产能、出砂和作业条件，不能简单追求更多孔或更深穿透。</p></div><button id=\"new\" class=\"btn primary\">换一口井 ↻</button></header><div class=\"demo-controls\"><div class=\"ctl\"><label>允许出砂代价上限 <output id=\"pv\"></output></label><input id=\"param\" aria-label=\"允许出砂代价上限\" type=\"range\" min=\"5\" max=\"60\" value=\"30\" step=\"1\"></div><div class=\"ctl\"><label>额外代价裕度 <output id=\"nv\"></output></label><input id=\"noise\" aria-label=\"噪声\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"20\"></div></div><div class=\"demo-body\"><section class=\"demo-charts charts\"><div class=\"legend\">橙：阈值/真值/推荐；绿：学习/策略；蓝：基线。各图按标注单位读取。</div><figure><figcaption>48组候选射孔组合的产能指数</figcaption><canvas id=\"a\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"48组候选射孔组合的产能指数\"></canvas></figure><figure><figcaption>产能—代价帕累托散点：绿前沿、灰被支配、橙推荐</figcaption><canvas id=\"b\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"产能—代价帕累托散点：绿前沿、灰被支配、橙推荐\"></canvas></figure><svg id=\"diagnostic\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"逐点误差分析\"></svg></section><aside class=\"demo-results\"><div id=\"metrics\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><p class=\"note\" id=\"explain\"></p><section class=\"inspect\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>逐点核对：计算结果与依据</h2><span id=\"position\"></span></div><label class=\"point-control\">选择位置<input id=\"point\" aria-label=\"核对位置\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"89\" value=\"25\"></label><div id=\"point-values\" class=\"point-values\"></div><p id=\"point-explain\"></p></section><details><summary>展开模型系数与结果明细</summary><pre id=\"report\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:12px/1.9 sans-serif;max-height:280px;overflow:auto;background:#f8f6ef;padding:10px\"></pre><p>双代理岭回归 + 帕累托筛选；训练/优化依据见实际模型明细，换井不重新训练。</p><p id=\"coeff\" class=\"coeff\"></p><div id=\"details\"></div></details><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"run\">重新计算</button><button id=\"reset\">恢复默认</button><button id=\"csv\">导出本次 CSV</button></div><p class=\"note\">产能与出砂代价均为合成无量纲指数，未作弹型、应力与真实产能计算。 全部数据为合成教学资料，结果需要独立井验证和人工复核。</p></aside></div></div><script src=\"demo.js\"></script></body></html>","mime":"text/html"},{"name":"demo/demo.css","size":7919,"enc":"text","data":"/* 示范页样式。运行在沙箱 iframe 里，随便写，不影响主站。 */\n:root{\n  --ink:#242b2e; --ink-2:#4d565b; --ink-3:#79828a;\n  --line:#e9e4d8; --jade:#2f7d6b; --jade-l:#e6f1ec;\n  --clay:#b26a39; --paper:#fbfaf6;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{\n  margin:0;padding:18px 20px 24px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:\"Inter\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;\n}\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}\nh1{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.78}\n.ctl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:9px}\n.ctl label{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-width:170px}\n.ctl output{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}\n.ctl input[type=range]{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade);height:18px}\nsvg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff}\n#ratio{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}\n.readouts{\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;\n  background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\n  margin-top:12px;\n}\n.ro{background:#fff;padding:9px 12px}\n.ro .k{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.06em}\n.ro b{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.ro b.ok{color:var(--jade)}\n.ro b.bad{color:var(--clay)}\n.note{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);line-height:1.75}\n.note b{color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* 保持样例底色、字号、控件和读数样式；增加逐点解释。 */\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:10.5px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--ink-2)}.dot:before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:5px}.truth:before{background:#2f7d6b}.model:before{background:#b26a39}.base:before{background:#41699b}.mud{background:#f4f7eb;padding:0 4px}#porosity,#residual{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}.inspect,details{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.section-head span{font-family:monospace;color:var(--jade)}.point-control{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:10px 0;font-size:12px}.point-control input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade)}.point-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.point-values div{padding:8px;background:#fff}.point-values span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}.point-values b{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace}#point-explain{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}details{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.actions button{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:5px;font:12px inherit;color:var(--jade);cursor:pointer}.actions span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:12px}.ctl{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px}.ctl label{min-width:100%}.readouts,.point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.section-head{display:block}}\n\n/* 与老师 welllog-layer 样例一致：标题说明右侧、参数条上方。 */\n.demo-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#f6f5ee}.demo-head>div{flex:1;min-width:220px}.demo-head .lead{margin-bottom:0}.kicker{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--jade)}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:7px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.btn.primary{background:var(--jade);border-color:var(--jade);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.btn.primary:hover{background:#256554;border-color:#256554}.btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--clay);outline-offset:3px}\n\n/* v2.2: fill the portal's full content width; match the reference's header/body structure. */\nbody{padding:0;background:var(--paper)}\n.panel{width:100%;max-width:none;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}\n.demo-head{margin:0;padding:14px 18px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;background:#fcfbf8;gap:18px}\n.demo-head>div{min-width:220px;flex:1}.demo-head h1{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px}.demo-head .lead{max-width:86ch;font-size:11.8px;line-height:1.7}\n.demo-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:14px 24px;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8f6f0}\n.demo-controls .ctl{flex:0 1 340px;margin:0;gap:12px;min-width:250px}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:135px;font-size:11.5px}.demo-controls .ctl input{min-width:90px;width:150px}\n.demo-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(320px,.9fr);align-items:start}\n.demo-charts{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}\n.demo-results{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px}.demo-charts .legend{margin:0 0 9px;gap:8px 12px}\n.demo-charts svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.demo-results .readouts{margin-top:0;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.demo-results .ro{padding:10px 12px}.demo-results .ro b{font-size:14px}.demo-results .note{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.8}\n.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values div{padding:9px 10px}\n.demo-results .section-head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.demo-results .section-head h2{font-size:12.5px}.demo-results .actions{gap:8px}.demo-results .actions span{flex-basis:100%}\n.demo-results .actions button{font-family:inherit;font-size:12px}.demo-results details{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.demo-results table{table-layout:fixed}button,input{touch-action:manipulation}\n@media(max-width:960px){.demo-body{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.demo-charts{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.demo-results .readouts{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:0}.panel{border-radius:9px}.demo-head,.demo-controls,.demo-charts,.demo-results{padding:12px}.demo-controls{gap:10px}.demo-controls .ctl{flex:1 1 100%;min-width:0;flex-wrap:nowrap}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:130px}.demo-results .readouts,.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-head h1{font-size:16px}.demo-head .btn{margin-left:auto}}\n\n.charts figure{margin:0 0 12px}.charts figcaption{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:6px}.charts canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;cursor:crosshair}#metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--line)}#metrics div{background:white;padding:10px}#metrics span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}#metrics strong{font:14px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--jade)}#details{overflow:auto}#details table{table-layout:auto;font-size:10px}.point-values b{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.point-values div{min-width:0}#diagnostic{margin-top:10px}.coeff{font-size:11px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}","mime":"text/css"},{"name":"demo/demo.js","size":14176,"enc":"text","data":"(function(){const TYPE=\"perforate\",SPEC={\"unit\":\"\",\"value\":30,\"inspect\":\"孔密单位孔/m，穿深m，相位度；产能/代价均为教学指数。pareto=1为非支配点，selected=1为约束内最高产能前沿候选。无可行点时不强推方案。\",\"classes\":[\"详见图内单位和说明\"]};\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id),clamp=(v,a,b)=>Math.max(a,Math.min(b,v));function rng(s){return()=>{s=(Math.imul(1664525,s)+1013904223)>>>0;return s/4294967296}}\nlet seed=91,rows=[],head=[],frame=0;\nfunction fit(data){let n=data[0].x.length,A=Array.from({length:n},()=>Array(n+1).fill(0));for(const {x,y} of data)for(let i=0;i<n;i++){for(let j=0;j<n;j++)A[i][j]+=x[i]*x[j];A[i][n]+=x[i]*y}for(let i=1;i<n;i++)A[i][i]+=.01;for(let i=0;i<n;i++){let p=i;for(let j=i+1;j<n;j++)if(Math.abs(A[j][i])>Math.abs(A[p][i]))p=j;[A[i],A[p]]=[A[p],A[i]];let v=A[i][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[i][j]/=v;for(let z=0;z<n;z++)if(z!==i){let q=A[z][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[z][j]-=q*A[i][j]}}return A.map(row=>row[n])}\nconst predict=(w,x)=>w.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+v*x[i],0),mae=(a,b)=>a.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-b[i]),0)/a.length;\nfunction chart(id,series,min,max,xlabel,ylabel,bands=[]){let c=$(id),g=c.getContext('2d'),w=640,h=340;g.clearRect(0,0,w,h);const px=i=>55+i/Math.max(1,series[0].values.length-1)*560,py=v=>285-(v-min)/(max-min)*240;\n bands.forEach(b=>{g.fillStyle=b.color;g.fillRect(px(b.start),45,px(b.end)-px(b.start),240)});\n g.font='12px sans-serif';g.lineWidth=1;for(let i=0;i<=4;i++){let v=min+(max-min)*i/4,y=py(v);g.strokeStyle='#dce5df';g.beginPath();g.moveTo(55,y);g.lineTo(615,y);g.stroke();g.fillStyle='#4b6259';g.fillText(v.toFixed(max-min<1?2:max<=3?1:0),4,y+4)}g.fillText(ylabel,55,22);g.fillText(xlabel,215,333);for(let i=0;i<=4;i++)g.fillText(Math.round(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4),px(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4)-5,306);\n series.forEach(s=>{g.strokeStyle=s.color;g.lineWidth=2;g.beginPath();s.values.forEach((v,i)=>{i?g.lineTo(px(i),py(v)):g.moveTo(px(i),py(v))});g.stroke()});}\nconst model=(()=>{let r=rng(17),data=[];if(TYPE==='select'){return Array.from({length:80},(_,i)=>{let sand=r(),water=r(),method=i%4;return {id:'H'+String(i+1).padStart(3,'0'),x:[sand,water],method,y:85-25*sand*(1-[.05,.15,.65,.9][method])-12*water-8*method+(r()-.5)*4}})}if(TYPE==='valve'){let q=Array.from({length:10},()=>[0,0,0]);for(let episode=0;episode<1600;episode++){let state=Math.floor(r()*9);for(let t=0;t<20;t++){let action=r()<.2?Math.floor(r()*3):q[state].indexOf(Math.max(...q[state])),water=state/9,open=[1,.6,.2][action],reward=100*open*(1-water)-100*open*water*.7,next=clamp(state+(action===0?1:action===1?(r()<.5?1:0):0),0,9);q[state][action]+=.15*(reward+.92*Math.max(...q[next])-q[state][action]);state=next}}return q}let a=[],b=[];for(let i=0;i<500;i++){let x=r(),y=r(),z=r(),features=TYPE==='perforate'?[1,x,y,z,x*y]:[1,x,y,x*y];a.push({x:features,y:TYPE==='perforate'?40+30*x+20*y+8*z+10*x*y:60+110*x+70*y+25*x*y});if(TYPE==='perforate')b.push({x:features,y:5+20*x+12*y+4*z+6*x*y})}return {primary:fit(a),risk:b.length?fit(b):null}})();\nfunction metrics(a){$('metrics').innerHTML=a.map(([a,b])=>'<div><span>'+a+'</span><strong>'+b+'</strong></div>').join('')}\nfunction run(){let p=+$('param').value,noise=+$('noise').value/100,r=rng(seed);$('pv').value=p;$('nv').value=noise.toFixed(2);$('seed').textContent=seed;$('report').textContent='';rows=[];\nif(TYPE==='select'){let sand=p/100,water=clamp(noise+((seed-91)%17)*.015,0,1),names=['裸眼','套管射孔','筛管','砾石充填'],scores=[],support=[];for(let m=0;m<4;m++){let near=model.filter(d=>d.method===m).map(d=>({...d,dist:(d.x[0]-sand)**2+(d.x[1]-water)**2})).sort((a,b)=>a.dist-b.dist).slice(0,3),estimate=near.reduce((s,d)=>s+d.y,0)/3,penalty=35*sand*(1-[.05,.15,.65,.9][m]),score=estimate-penalty;scores.push(score);support.push(near.map(d=>d.id).join('/'))}let best=scores.indexOf(Math.max(...scores));chart('a',[{values:scores,color:'#43836b'}],0,100,'方案编号 0裸眼 / 1射孔 / 2筛管 / 3砾石充填','相似案例效益 − 出砂惩罚 / 教学分数');chart('b',[{values:[sand,water],color:'#c59048'}],0,1,'特征编号 0出砂倾向 / 1出水代理','输入特征（0–1）');metrics([['候选首位',names[best]],['最高教学评分',scores[best].toFixed(1)],['历史合成案例','80 条'],['每方案引用','3 条近邻']]);$('explain').textContent='以出砂和出水代理的欧氏距离检索每种方式最近的三个历史合成案例，均值效益减去手工知识规则的防砂不足惩罚后排序。该实现为案例推理与规则融合，不是训练好的知识图谱或产能模型。第一滑块为出砂倾向，第二滑块为出水基础代理；换井叠加固定井间差异，实际值见右图。评分无货币单位，不等于真实收益，不能据此直接选现场方案。';$('report').textContent=names.map((n,i)=>n+'：引用 '+support[i]+'，评分 '+scores[i].toFixed(2)).join('\\n');head=['method','score','source_case_ids'];rows=names.map((v,i)=>[v,scores[i],support[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='perforate'){let candidates=[];for(let density of [8,12,16,20])for(let depth of [.2,.4,.6,.8])for(let phase of [60,90,120]){let x=(density-8)/12,y=(depth-.2)/.6,z=(phase-60)/60,features=[1,x,y,z,x*y],production=predict(model.primary,features),risk=predict(model.risk,features)+noise*8+((seed-91)%17)*.12;candidates.push({density,depth,phase,production,risk})}let front=candidates.filter(a=>!candidates.some(b=>b.production>=a.production&&b.risk<=a.risk&&(b.production>a.production||b.risk<a.risk))),feasible=front.filter(c=>c.risk<=p),best=feasible.sort((a,b)=>b.production-a.production)[0];chart('a',[{values:candidates.map(c=>c.production),color:'#43836b'}],30,120,'候选组合编号（48 组）','预测产能指数 / 无量纲');chart('b',[{values:candidates.map(c=>c.risk),color:'#43836b'},{values:candidates.map(()=>p),color:'#c59048'}],0,70,'候选组合编号','出砂代价指数 / 教学分数');drawPareto(candidates,front,best,p);metrics([['帕累托候选',front.length+' / 48'],['约束内前沿点',feasible.length],['推荐孔密',best?best.density+' 孔/m':'无可行方案'],['推荐穿深 / 相位',best?best.depth+' m / '+best.phase+'°':'—']]);$('explain').textContent='500 个独立合成训练组合分别拟合产能和出砂代价代理；枚举孔密、穿深、相位共 48 组，剔除被其他方案同时“更高产能、更低代价”支配的点，形成帕累托前沿。第一滑块为允许代价上限，第二滑块增加代价裕度，换井叠加固定的井间代价差异。前沿内筛选最高预测产能，无可行点时返回无解。代价不是概率；未做射孔弹、岩石力学或真实产能计算。';$('report').textContent='帕累托前沿组合：\\n'+front.map(c=>c.density+'孔/m，'+c.depth+'m，'+c.phase+'°，产能指数'+c.production.toFixed(1)+'，代价'+c.risk.toFixed(1)).join('\\n');head=['density_shots_m','penetration_m','phase_deg','productivity_index','sand_cost_index','pareto','selected'];rows=candidates.map(c=>[c.density,c.depth,c.phase,c.production,c.risk,front.includes(c)?1:0,c===best?1:0]);}\nif(TYPE==='stress'){let truth=[],pred=[],base=[],factors=[];for(let i=0;i<100;i++){let t=p/100,pressure=.5+.4*Math.sin((i+seed%19)/16),y=60+110*t+70*pressure+25*t*pressure,observed=clamp(t+(r()-.5)*noise,0,1);truth.push(y);pred.push(predict(model.primary,[1,observed,pressure,observed*pressure]));base.push(180);factors.push(300/Math.max(1,pred[i]))}chart('a',[{values:truth,color:'#c59048'},{values:pred,color:'#43836b'},{values:base,color:'#648eae'}],0,300,'工况组合序号（压力代理随序号变化）','等效载荷代理 / MPa');chart('b',[{values:factors,color:'#43836b'},{values:factors.map(()=>1.5),color:'#c59048'}],0,6,'工况组合序号','教学强度限值 / 预测载荷');metrics([['预测 MAE',(pred.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-truth[i]),0)/100).toFixed(2)+' MPa'],['固定基线 MAE',(base.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-truth[i]),0)/100).toFixed(2)+' MPa'],['最小代理安全系数',Math.min(...factors).toFixed(2)],['低于教学目标工况',factors.filter(v=>v<1.5).length+' / 100']]);$('explain').textContent='500 个合成温压工况训练含交互项的岭回归，预测等效载荷代理。第一滑块为归一化温差×100，第二滑块为温度观测噪声。橙：真值；绿：代理；蓝：固定 180 MPa。300 MPa 强度和 1.5 目标均为教学假设，不对应钢级规范；未实现轴力、弯曲、屈曲、接头泄漏或疲劳验算。';head=['scenario','truth_load_MPa','predicted_load_MPa','fixed_load_MPa','proxy_safety_factor'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,v,pred[i],base[i],factors[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='valve'){let policy=[],baseline=[],waterCurve=[],states=[],actions=[],s=1+seed%3,b=1+seed%3,total=0,totalBase=0;for(let t=0;t<60;t++){let sensed=clamp(Math.round(s+(r()-.5)*noise*4),0,9),cost=p/100,a=model[sensed].indexOf(Math.max(...model[sensed])),op=[1,.6,.2][a],w=s/9,wb=b/9,reward=100*op*(1-w)-100*op*w*cost,rb=100*(1-wb)-100*wb*cost;total+=reward;totalBase+=rb;policy.push(total);baseline.push(totalBase);waterCurve.push(w);states.push(s);actions.push(op);s=clamp(s+(a===0?1:a===1?(r()<.5?1:0):0),0,9);b=clamp(b+1,0,9)}chart('a',[{values:policy,color:'#43836b'},{values:baseline,color:'#648eae'}],-6000,2000,'控制步（每步为一个教学时间单位）','累计净收益 / 无量纲');chart('b',[{values:actions,color:'#43836b'},{values:waterCurve,color:'#c59048'}],0,1.1,'控制步','绿：滑套开度 / 橙：含水代理');metrics([['Q 策略累计收益',total.toFixed(1)],['全开基线收益',totalBase.toFixed(1)],['训练回合','1600'],['平均开度',(actions.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0)/60).toFixed(2)]]);$('explain').textContent='在十档含水状态、三档开度的简化环境中训练表格 Q-learning（1600 回合）。开度影响产液贡献与含水状态上升。训练水代价固定 0.7，第一滑块改变测试水代价，展示目标迁移时的表现；第二滑块模拟状态观测误差。策略训练后固定，与全开策略从相同初始状态比较，各自按动作演化。该例只控制单个等效区段，不模拟多段干扰、真实储层或累计产油体积。';head=['step','state','opening','water_proxy','Q_policy_cumulative_reward','all_open_cumulative_reward'];rows=policy.map((v,i)=>[i,states[i],actions[i],waterCurve[i],v,baseline[i]]);}\n$('details').innerHTML='<table><tr>'+head.map(v=>'<th>'+v+'</th>').join('')+'</tr>'+rows.slice(0,5).map(row=>'<tr>'+row.map(v=>'<td>'+(typeof v==='number'?v.toFixed(3):v)+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</table>';\n}\nfunction flush(){if(frame){cancelAnimationFrame(frame);frame=0}run()}function schedule(){$('pv').value=$('param').value;$('nv').value=(+$('noise').value/100).toFixed(2);if(!frame)frame=requestAnimationFrame(()=>{frame=0;run()})}for(const id of ['param','noise']){$(id).oninput=schedule;$(id).onchange=flush}$('run').onclick=flush;$('new').onclick=()=>{seed+=13;flush()};$('csv').onclick=()=>{if(frame)flush();let q=v=>'\"'+String(v).replace(/\"/g,'\"\"')+'\"',blob=new Blob(['\\ufeff'+[head,...rows].map(row=>row.map(q).join(',')).join('\\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),u=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=u;a.download='completion-'+TYPE+'-'+seed+'.csv';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(u),1000)};\n\nlet selected=0;const rawRun=run;run=function(){rawRun();inspect();diagnostic();$('coeff').textContent=TYPE==='select'?'80条带H编号的独立合成历史案例；每方案按输入距离检索3条，再叠加防砂规则。':TYPE==='valve'?'实际Q表（行=含水状态0至9，列=开度1/0.6/0.2）：'+JSON.stringify(model):'实际学习系数：'+JSON.stringify(model)};\nfunction inspect(){selected=Math.max(0,Math.min(rows.length-1,selected));$('point').max=rows.length-1;$('point').value=selected;$('position').textContent='序号 '+selected;let row=rows[selected];$('point-values').innerHTML=head.map((k,j)=>'<div><span>'+k+'</span><b>'+(typeof row[j]==='number'?row[j].toFixed(4):row[j])+'</b></div>').join('');$('point-explain').textContent=SPEC.inspect;}\nfunction diagnostic(){let a=rows.map((r,i)=>TYPE==='select'?r[1]:TYPE==='perforate'?Math.max(0,r[4]-+$('param').value):TYPE==='stress'?r[2]-r[1]:r[4]-r[5]),max=Math.max(.001,...a.map(Math.abs)),label=TYPE==='select'?'各完井方案最终教学评分（高分优先，不是收益金额）':TYPE==='perforate'?'各候选超出出砂代价上限的缺口（0为满足代价约束）':TYPE==='stress'?'逐工况预测载荷−合成真值 / MPa':'Q策略−全开基线的累计收益差 / 无量纲';$('diagnostic').innerHTML='<text x=\"35\" y=\"16\" fill=\"#79828a\" font-size=\"11\">'+label+'</text><path d=\"M35 85H685\" stroke=\"#ded9cc\"/>'+a.map((v,i)=>'<rect x=\"'+(35+i/a.length*650)+'\" y=\"'+(v>=0?85-v/max*55:85)+'\" width=\"'+Math.max(1,650/a.length-3)+'\" height=\"'+Math.max(.6,Math.abs(v)/max*55)+'\" fill=\"'+(v>=0?'#2f7d6b':'#b26a39')+'\"/>').join('');}\n$('point').addEventListener('input',()=>{selected=+$('point').value;inspect()});$('a').addEventListener('click',ev=>{let r=$('a').getBoundingClientRect(),x=(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width*640;selected=Math.round(Math.max(0,Math.min(1,(x-55)/560))*(rows.length-1));inspect()});$('reset').onclick=()=>{seed=91;$('param').value=SPEC.value;$('noise').value=20;selected=0;flush()};\n\nrun();\n\nfunction drawPareto(all,front,best,limit){let g=$('b').getContext('2d');g.clearRect(0,0,640,340);g.font='12px sans-serif';const px=v=>55+v/70*550,py=v=>285-(v-30)/90*240;g.strokeStyle='#d5dfd3';for(let i=0;i<5;i++){g.beginPath();g.moveTo(55,45+i*60);g.lineTo(610,45+i*60);g.stroke();g.fillStyle='#345647';g.fillText(120-i*22.5,5,45+i*60)}g.strokeStyle='#c59048';g.beginPath();g.moveTo(px(limit),35);g.lineTo(px(limit),290);g.stroke();for(let a of all){g.fillStyle=a===best?'#c59048':front.includes(a)?'#43836b':'#aeb8af';let size=a===best?9:front.includes(a)?6:4;g.fillRect(px(a.risk)-size/2,py(a.production)-size/2,size,size)}g.fillStyle='#345647';g.fillText('产能指数 ↑；绿：帕累托 / 灰：被支配 / 橙：选择与上限',25,20);g.fillText('横轴：出砂代价指数 0 → 70（橙线为允许上限）',100,325)}\r\n\n})();","mime":"text/javascript"}];c.tabs.demo={label:"可运行示范",mount(root){let h=CaseDemoHost.create(root,{files,demo},{scene:ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId],kase:c});return ()=>h.destroy()}};Cases.register(c);ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].demo=true;}
{const c={"id":"completion-stress-v22","sceneId":"co3","title":"完井管柱受力智能分析：交互式学习实验","status":"ready","version":"2.2.0","updated":"2026-11-02","tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","lede":"生产管柱的温度与压力变化可能导致伸缩和载荷改变；受封隔器等约束时，位移与力需要共同考虑。简单温压代理不能替代完整力学校核。","judge":[{"label":"方法","value":"含交互项岭回归载荷代理","desc":"纯前端实际计算"},{"label":"数据","value":"教学合成","desc":"独立训练与测试"},{"label":"输出","value":"载荷曲线、残差与代理安全系数","desc":"可视化与 CSV"},{"label":"范围","value":"教学演示","desc":"不实现真实轴力、屈曲、接头和疲劳分析，强度及目标系数均为教学假设。"}],"sections":[{"no":1,"en":"CONCEPT","title":"专业概念与背景","html":"<figure style=\"margin:0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 180\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"完井专业概念\"><path d=\"M90 20V150M155 20V150\" stroke=\"#77978a\" stroke-width=\"14\"/><path d=\"M70 35H175M70 140H175\" stroke=\"#c59048\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><g font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#345647\"><text x=\"230\" y=\"45\">温差 → 热伸缩；压力 → 载荷变化</text><text x=\"230\" y=\"90\">端部约束使位移与力相互关联</text><text x=\"230\" y=\"135\">代理预测仅用于理解工况敏感性</text></g></svg><figcaption>原理示意，不代表现场结构、产能或力学验算。</figcaption></figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"完井管柱受力智能分析概念\"><rect width=\"760\" height=\"170\" fill=\"#eef4e9\"/><path d=\"M20 130L60 120L100 125L140 60L180 65L220 80L260 40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#43836b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#345648\">完井管柱受力智能分析</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"155\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#345648\">温压工况 → 交互特征 → 回归代理 → 风险工况</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#345648\">储层 / 温压 / 生产状态 → 建模与决策 → 可复核候选</text></svg><p>概念示意，非现场曲线。具体坐标和单位见案例演示。</p><p>生产管柱的温度与压力变化可能导致伸缩和载荷改变；受封隔器等约束时，位移与力需要共同考虑。简单温压代理不能替代完整力学校核。</p>"},{"no":2,"en":"AI","title":"方法与介入点","html":"<p>输入：合成温差和压力代理、载荷标签。方法：含交互项岭回归载荷代理。输出：载荷曲线、残差与代理安全系数。</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px\"><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>01</b><p>生成独立温压工况</p><small>输入与标签</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>02</b><p>训练交互项回归</p><small>模型与特征</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>03</b><p>扫描测试工况</p><small>预测与决策</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>04</b><p>比较固定载荷基线</p><small>误差与来源</small></div></div><p>温压工况 → 交互特征 → 回归代理 → 风险工况。</p>"},{"no":3,"en":"DATA","title":"数据要求与验证","html":"<p>真实应用需要同井段配对的合成温差和压力代理、载荷标签，并由施工结果、胶结解释或独立验证资料提供标签。先做小规模概念验证，再按井、样品或连续时间块留出测试，避免相邻样本泄漏。</p><p>本演示训练种子 17、测试初始种子 91；代理从独立合成样本拟合；优选采用案例推理与规则；滑套采用表格强化学习。所有样本均为教学合成。</p>"},{"no":4,"en":"LIMIT","title":"局限与参考","html":"<p>不实现真实轴力、屈曲、接头和疲劳分析，强度及目标系数均为教学假设。</p><p><a href=\"https://glossary.slb.com/en/terms/c/completion_bond_log\">SLB：防砂完井概念</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.neighbors.NearestCentroid.html\">最近类中心原理</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/linear_model.html\">回归与逻辑回归原理</a>。合成公式与示范为本项目独立教学实现。</p>"}]},"workflow":{"label":"案例流程","title":"完井管柱受力智能分析：输入到验收","lead":["每一步均对应演示里的计算或证据。调节滑块观察成像、噪声、平滑或审核阈值的影响。"],"stats":[["运行","浏览器"],["数据","合成"],["输出","可导出"]],"steps":[{"name":"01 生成独立温压工况","role":"数据","do":"合成温差和压力代理、载荷标签按深度对齐，按独立井留出测试。","effect":"规范输入及标签","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"02 训练交互项回归","role":"学习","do":"按各例方法建立案例检索、回归代理或 Q 表；不使用测试标签拟合。","effect":"可复用的训练模型","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"03 扫描测试工况","role":"推理","do":"温压工况 → 交互特征 → 回归代理 → 风险工况；第一滑块调节当前实验参数。","effect":"可视预测与候选","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"04 比较固定载荷基线","role":"验收","do":"比较真值与基线，导出 CSV 并复核误差。","effect":"基线比较或来源审核","trap":"不实现真实轴力、屈曲、接头和疲劳分析，强度及目标系数均为教学假设。"}],"metrics":{"title":"步骤映射与评价口径","html":"<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px\"><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>01</b><p>生成独立温压工况</p><small>输入与标签</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>02</b><p>训练交互项回归</p><small>模型与特征</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>03</b><p>扫描测试工况</p><small>预测与决策</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>04</b><p>比较固定载荷基线</p><small>误差与来源</small></div></div><p>分类准确率 = 正确数 / 测试数；F1 = 2TP/(2TP+FP+FN)。层界按 ±2 m 一对一匹配；报告引用覆盖率仅表示有来源，不等于语义正确率。后验分数未经校准。</p><p>MAE 以合成载荷真值验收；代理安全系数 = 教学强度 300 MPa / 预测载荷。</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 105\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"数据到决策与验收\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">独立资料</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"192\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">学习模型</text><rect x=\"360\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">候选 / 预测</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"552\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">误差与约束复核</text></svg>"},"fails":[{"name":"采集与工况变化","why":"井况、浆体与地层压力变化可影响结果。"},{"name":"标签与对齐","why":"深度归位、采样尺度与人工解释歧义可能影响真值。"},{"name":"边界","why":"不实现真实轴力、屈曲、接头和疲劳分析，强度及目标系数均为教学假设。"}]},"demo":{"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850}}},demo={"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850},files=[{"name":"demo/index.html","size":2995,"enc":"text","data":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>完井管柱受力智能分析</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"demo.css\"></head><body><div class=\"panel\"><header class=\"demo-head\"><div><span class=\"kicker\">独立合成测试井 · 种子 <span id=\"seed\"></span></span><h1>完井管柱受力智能分析</h1><p class=\"lead\">生产管柱的温度与压力变化可能导致伸缩和载荷改变；受封隔器等约束时，位移与力需要共同考虑。简单温压代理不能替代完整力学校核。</p></div><button id=\"new\" class=\"btn primary\">换一口井 ↻</button></header><div class=\"demo-controls\"><div class=\"ctl\"><label>归一化温差 ×100 <output id=\"pv\"></output></label><input id=\"param\" aria-label=\"归一化温差 ×100\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"50\" step=\"1\"></div><div class=\"ctl\"><label>温度观测噪声 <output id=\"nv\"></output></label><input id=\"noise\" aria-label=\"噪声\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"20\"></div></div><div class=\"demo-body\"><section class=\"demo-charts charts\"><div class=\"legend\">橙：阈值/真值/推荐；绿：学习/策略；蓝：基线。各图按标注单位读取。</div><figure><figcaption>等效载荷代理：真值、预测与固定基线</figcaption><canvas id=\"a\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"等效载荷代理：真值、预测与固定基线\"></canvas></figure><figure><figcaption>代理安全系数及教学目标1.5</figcaption><canvas id=\"b\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"代理安全系数及教学目标1.5\"></canvas></figure><svg id=\"diagnostic\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"逐点误差分析\"></svg></section><aside class=\"demo-results\"><div id=\"metrics\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><p class=\"note\" id=\"explain\"></p><section class=\"inspect\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>逐点核对：计算结果与依据</h2><span id=\"position\"></span></div><label class=\"point-control\">选择位置<input id=\"point\" aria-label=\"核对位置\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"89\" value=\"25\"></label><div id=\"point-values\" class=\"point-values\"></div><p id=\"point-explain\"></p></section><details><summary>展开模型系数与结果明细</summary><pre id=\"report\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:12px/1.9 sans-serif;max-height:280px;overflow:auto;background:#f8f6ef;padding:10px\"></pre><p>含交互项岭回归载荷代理；训练/优化依据见实际模型明细，换井不重新训练。</p><p id=\"coeff\" class=\"coeff\"></p><div id=\"details\"></div></details><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"run\">重新计算</button><button id=\"reset\">恢复默认</button><button id=\"csv\">导出本次 CSV</button></div><p class=\"note\">不实现真实轴力、屈曲、接头和疲劳分析，强度及目标系数均为教学假设。 全部数据为合成教学资料，结果需要独立井验证和人工复核。</p></aside></div></div><script src=\"demo.js\"></script></body></html>","mime":"text/html"},{"name":"demo/demo.css","size":7919,"enc":"text","data":"/* 示范页样式。运行在沙箱 iframe 里，随便写，不影响主站。 */\n:root{\n  --ink:#242b2e; --ink-2:#4d565b; --ink-3:#79828a;\n  --line:#e9e4d8; --jade:#2f7d6b; --jade-l:#e6f1ec;\n  --clay:#b26a39; --paper:#fbfaf6;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{\n  margin:0;padding:18px 20px 24px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:\"Inter\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;\n}\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}\nh1{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.78}\n.ctl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:9px}\n.ctl label{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-width:170px}\n.ctl output{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}\n.ctl input[type=range]{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade);height:18px}\nsvg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff}\n#ratio{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}\n.readouts{\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;\n  background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\n  margin-top:12px;\n}\n.ro{background:#fff;padding:9px 12px}\n.ro .k{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.06em}\n.ro b{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.ro b.ok{color:var(--jade)}\n.ro b.bad{color:var(--clay)}\n.note{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);line-height:1.75}\n.note b{color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* 保持样例底色、字号、控件和读数样式；增加逐点解释。 */\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:10.5px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--ink-2)}.dot:before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:5px}.truth:before{background:#2f7d6b}.model:before{background:#b26a39}.base:before{background:#41699b}.mud{background:#f4f7eb;padding:0 4px}#porosity,#residual{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}.inspect,details{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.section-head span{font-family:monospace;color:var(--jade)}.point-control{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:10px 0;font-size:12px}.point-control input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade)}.point-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.point-values div{padding:8px;background:#fff}.point-values span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}.point-values b{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace}#point-explain{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}details{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.actions button{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:5px;font:12px inherit;color:var(--jade);cursor:pointer}.actions span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:12px}.ctl{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px}.ctl label{min-width:100%}.readouts,.point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.section-head{display:block}}\n\n/* 与老师 welllog-layer 样例一致：标题说明右侧、参数条上方。 */\n.demo-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#f6f5ee}.demo-head>div{flex:1;min-width:220px}.demo-head .lead{margin-bottom:0}.kicker{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--jade)}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:7px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.btn.primary{background:var(--jade);border-color:var(--jade);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.btn.primary:hover{background:#256554;border-color:#256554}.btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--clay);outline-offset:3px}\n\n/* v2.2: fill the portal's full content width; match the reference's header/body structure. */\nbody{padding:0;background:var(--paper)}\n.panel{width:100%;max-width:none;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}\n.demo-head{margin:0;padding:14px 18px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;background:#fcfbf8;gap:18px}\n.demo-head>div{min-width:220px;flex:1}.demo-head h1{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px}.demo-head .lead{max-width:86ch;font-size:11.8px;line-height:1.7}\n.demo-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:14px 24px;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8f6f0}\n.demo-controls .ctl{flex:0 1 340px;margin:0;gap:12px;min-width:250px}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:135px;font-size:11.5px}.demo-controls .ctl input{min-width:90px;width:150px}\n.demo-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(320px,.9fr);align-items:start}\n.demo-charts{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}\n.demo-results{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px}.demo-charts .legend{margin:0 0 9px;gap:8px 12px}\n.demo-charts svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.demo-results .readouts{margin-top:0;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.demo-results .ro{padding:10px 12px}.demo-results .ro b{font-size:14px}.demo-results .note{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.8}\n.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values div{padding:9px 10px}\n.demo-results .section-head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.demo-results .section-head h2{font-size:12.5px}.demo-results .actions{gap:8px}.demo-results .actions span{flex-basis:100%}\n.demo-results .actions button{font-family:inherit;font-size:12px}.demo-results details{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.demo-results table{table-layout:fixed}button,input{touch-action:manipulation}\n@media(max-width:960px){.demo-body{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.demo-charts{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.demo-results .readouts{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:0}.panel{border-radius:9px}.demo-head,.demo-controls,.demo-charts,.demo-results{padding:12px}.demo-controls{gap:10px}.demo-controls .ctl{flex:1 1 100%;min-width:0;flex-wrap:nowrap}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:130px}.demo-results .readouts,.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-head h1{font-size:16px}.demo-head .btn{margin-left:auto}}\n\n.charts figure{margin:0 0 12px}.charts figcaption{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:6px}.charts canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;cursor:crosshair}#metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--line)}#metrics div{background:white;padding:10px}#metrics span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}#metrics strong{font:14px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--jade)}#details{overflow:auto}#details table{table-layout:auto;font-size:10px}.point-values b{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.point-values div{min-width:0}#diagnostic{margin-top:10px}.coeff{font-size:11px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}","mime":"text/css"},{"name":"demo/demo.js","size":14142,"enc":"text","data":"(function(){const TYPE=\"stress\",SPEC={\"unit\":\"\",\"value\":50,\"inspect\":\"MPa是本例等效载荷代理单位，安全系数为假设强度300除以预测载荷；1.5为教学目标，不是钢级规范或完整管柱校核。\",\"classes\":[\"详见图内单位和说明\"]};\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id),clamp=(v,a,b)=>Math.max(a,Math.min(b,v));function rng(s){return()=>{s=(Math.imul(1664525,s)+1013904223)>>>0;return s/4294967296}}\nlet seed=91,rows=[],head=[],frame=0;\nfunction fit(data){let n=data[0].x.length,A=Array.from({length:n},()=>Array(n+1).fill(0));for(const {x,y} of data)for(let i=0;i<n;i++){for(let j=0;j<n;j++)A[i][j]+=x[i]*x[j];A[i][n]+=x[i]*y}for(let i=1;i<n;i++)A[i][i]+=.01;for(let i=0;i<n;i++){let p=i;for(let j=i+1;j<n;j++)if(Math.abs(A[j][i])>Math.abs(A[p][i]))p=j;[A[i],A[p]]=[A[p],A[i]];let v=A[i][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[i][j]/=v;for(let z=0;z<n;z++)if(z!==i){let q=A[z][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[z][j]-=q*A[i][j]}}return A.map(row=>row[n])}\nconst predict=(w,x)=>w.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+v*x[i],0),mae=(a,b)=>a.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-b[i]),0)/a.length;\nfunction chart(id,series,min,max,xlabel,ylabel,bands=[]){let c=$(id),g=c.getContext('2d'),w=640,h=340;g.clearRect(0,0,w,h);const px=i=>55+i/Math.max(1,series[0].values.length-1)*560,py=v=>285-(v-min)/(max-min)*240;\n bands.forEach(b=>{g.fillStyle=b.color;g.fillRect(px(b.start),45,px(b.end)-px(b.start),240)});\n g.font='12px sans-serif';g.lineWidth=1;for(let i=0;i<=4;i++){let v=min+(max-min)*i/4,y=py(v);g.strokeStyle='#dce5df';g.beginPath();g.moveTo(55,y);g.lineTo(615,y);g.stroke();g.fillStyle='#4b6259';g.fillText(v.toFixed(max-min<1?2:max<=3?1:0),4,y+4)}g.fillText(ylabel,55,22);g.fillText(xlabel,215,333);for(let i=0;i<=4;i++)g.fillText(Math.round(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4),px(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4)-5,306);\n series.forEach(s=>{g.strokeStyle=s.color;g.lineWidth=2;g.beginPath();s.values.forEach((v,i)=>{i?g.lineTo(px(i),py(v)):g.moveTo(px(i),py(v))});g.stroke()});}\nconst model=(()=>{let r=rng(17),data=[];if(TYPE==='select'){return Array.from({length:80},(_,i)=>{let sand=r(),water=r(),method=i%4;return {id:'H'+String(i+1).padStart(3,'0'),x:[sand,water],method,y:85-25*sand*(1-[.05,.15,.65,.9][method])-12*water-8*method+(r()-.5)*4}})}if(TYPE==='valve'){let q=Array.from({length:10},()=>[0,0,0]);for(let episode=0;episode<1600;episode++){let state=Math.floor(r()*9);for(let t=0;t<20;t++){let action=r()<.2?Math.floor(r()*3):q[state].indexOf(Math.max(...q[state])),water=state/9,open=[1,.6,.2][action],reward=100*open*(1-water)-100*open*water*.7,next=clamp(state+(action===0?1:action===1?(r()<.5?1:0):0),0,9);q[state][action]+=.15*(reward+.92*Math.max(...q[next])-q[state][action]);state=next}}return q}let a=[],b=[];for(let i=0;i<500;i++){let x=r(),y=r(),z=r(),features=TYPE==='perforate'?[1,x,y,z,x*y]:[1,x,y,x*y];a.push({x:features,y:TYPE==='perforate'?40+30*x+20*y+8*z+10*x*y:60+110*x+70*y+25*x*y});if(TYPE==='perforate')b.push({x:features,y:5+20*x+12*y+4*z+6*x*y})}return {primary:fit(a),risk:b.length?fit(b):null}})();\nfunction metrics(a){$('metrics').innerHTML=a.map(([a,b])=>'<div><span>'+a+'</span><strong>'+b+'</strong></div>').join('')}\nfunction run(){let p=+$('param').value,noise=+$('noise').value/100,r=rng(seed);$('pv').value=p;$('nv').value=noise.toFixed(2);$('seed').textContent=seed;$('report').textContent='';rows=[];\nif(TYPE==='select'){let sand=p/100,water=clamp(noise+((seed-91)%17)*.015,0,1),names=['裸眼','套管射孔','筛管','砾石充填'],scores=[],support=[];for(let m=0;m<4;m++){let near=model.filter(d=>d.method===m).map(d=>({...d,dist:(d.x[0]-sand)**2+(d.x[1]-water)**2})).sort((a,b)=>a.dist-b.dist).slice(0,3),estimate=near.reduce((s,d)=>s+d.y,0)/3,penalty=35*sand*(1-[.05,.15,.65,.9][m]),score=estimate-penalty;scores.push(score);support.push(near.map(d=>d.id).join('/'))}let best=scores.indexOf(Math.max(...scores));chart('a',[{values:scores,color:'#43836b'}],0,100,'方案编号 0裸眼 / 1射孔 / 2筛管 / 3砾石充填','相似案例效益 − 出砂惩罚 / 教学分数');chart('b',[{values:[sand,water],color:'#c59048'}],0,1,'特征编号 0出砂倾向 / 1出水代理','输入特征（0–1）');metrics([['候选首位',names[best]],['最高教学评分',scores[best].toFixed(1)],['历史合成案例','80 条'],['每方案引用','3 条近邻']]);$('explain').textContent='以出砂和出水代理的欧氏距离检索每种方式最近的三个历史合成案例，均值效益减去手工知识规则的防砂不足惩罚后排序。该实现为案例推理与规则融合，不是训练好的知识图谱或产能模型。第一滑块为出砂倾向，第二滑块为出水基础代理；换井叠加固定井间差异，实际值见右图。评分无货币单位，不等于真实收益，不能据此直接选现场方案。';$('report').textContent=names.map((n,i)=>n+'：引用 '+support[i]+'，评分 '+scores[i].toFixed(2)).join('\\n');head=['method','score','source_case_ids'];rows=names.map((v,i)=>[v,scores[i],support[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='perforate'){let candidates=[];for(let density of [8,12,16,20])for(let depth of [.2,.4,.6,.8])for(let phase of [60,90,120]){let x=(density-8)/12,y=(depth-.2)/.6,z=(phase-60)/60,features=[1,x,y,z,x*y],production=predict(model.primary,features),risk=predict(model.risk,features)+noise*8+((seed-91)%17)*.12;candidates.push({density,depth,phase,production,risk})}let front=candidates.filter(a=>!candidates.some(b=>b.production>=a.production&&b.risk<=a.risk&&(b.production>a.production||b.risk<a.risk))),feasible=front.filter(c=>c.risk<=p),best=feasible.sort((a,b)=>b.production-a.production)[0];chart('a',[{values:candidates.map(c=>c.production),color:'#43836b'}],30,120,'候选组合编号（48 组）','预测产能指数 / 无量纲');chart('b',[{values:candidates.map(c=>c.risk),color:'#43836b'},{values:candidates.map(()=>p),color:'#c59048'}],0,70,'候选组合编号','出砂代价指数 / 教学分数');drawPareto(candidates,front,best,p);metrics([['帕累托候选',front.length+' / 48'],['约束内前沿点',feasible.length],['推荐孔密',best?best.density+' 孔/m':'无可行方案'],['推荐穿深 / 相位',best?best.depth+' m / '+best.phase+'°':'—']]);$('explain').textContent='500 个独立合成训练组合分别拟合产能和出砂代价代理；枚举孔密、穿深、相位共 48 组，剔除被其他方案同时“更高产能、更低代价”支配的点，形成帕累托前沿。第一滑块为允许代价上限，第二滑块增加代价裕度，换井叠加固定的井间代价差异。前沿内筛选最高预测产能，无可行点时返回无解。代价不是概率；未做射孔弹、岩石力学或真实产能计算。';$('report').textContent='帕累托前沿组合：\\n'+front.map(c=>c.density+'孔/m，'+c.depth+'m，'+c.phase+'°，产能指数'+c.production.toFixed(1)+'，代价'+c.risk.toFixed(1)).join('\\n');head=['density_shots_m','penetration_m','phase_deg','productivity_index','sand_cost_index','pareto','selected'];rows=candidates.map(c=>[c.density,c.depth,c.phase,c.production,c.risk,front.includes(c)?1:0,c===best?1:0]);}\nif(TYPE==='stress'){let truth=[],pred=[],base=[],factors=[];for(let i=0;i<100;i++){let t=p/100,pressure=.5+.4*Math.sin((i+seed%19)/16),y=60+110*t+70*pressure+25*t*pressure,observed=clamp(t+(r()-.5)*noise,0,1);truth.push(y);pred.push(predict(model.primary,[1,observed,pressure,observed*pressure]));base.push(180);factors.push(300/Math.max(1,pred[i]))}chart('a',[{values:truth,color:'#c59048'},{values:pred,color:'#43836b'},{values:base,color:'#648eae'}],0,300,'工况组合序号（压力代理随序号变化）','等效载荷代理 / MPa');chart('b',[{values:factors,color:'#43836b'},{values:factors.map(()=>1.5),color:'#c59048'}],0,6,'工况组合序号','教学强度限值 / 预测载荷');metrics([['预测 MAE',(pred.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-truth[i]),0)/100).toFixed(2)+' MPa'],['固定基线 MAE',(base.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-truth[i]),0)/100).toFixed(2)+' MPa'],['最小代理安全系数',Math.min(...factors).toFixed(2)],['低于教学目标工况',factors.filter(v=>v<1.5).length+' / 100']]);$('explain').textContent='500 个合成温压工况训练含交互项的岭回归，预测等效载荷代理。第一滑块为归一化温差×100，第二滑块为温度观测噪声。橙：真值；绿：代理；蓝：固定 180 MPa。300 MPa 强度和 1.5 目标均为教学假设，不对应钢级规范；未实现轴力、弯曲、屈曲、接头泄漏或疲劳验算。';head=['scenario','truth_load_MPa','predicted_load_MPa','fixed_load_MPa','proxy_safety_factor'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,v,pred[i],base[i],factors[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='valve'){let policy=[],baseline=[],waterCurve=[],states=[],actions=[],s=1+seed%3,b=1+seed%3,total=0,totalBase=0;for(let t=0;t<60;t++){let sensed=clamp(Math.round(s+(r()-.5)*noise*4),0,9),cost=p/100,a=model[sensed].indexOf(Math.max(...model[sensed])),op=[1,.6,.2][a],w=s/9,wb=b/9,reward=100*op*(1-w)-100*op*w*cost,rb=100*(1-wb)-100*wb*cost;total+=reward;totalBase+=rb;policy.push(total);baseline.push(totalBase);waterCurve.push(w);states.push(s);actions.push(op);s=clamp(s+(a===0?1:a===1?(r()<.5?1:0):0),0,9);b=clamp(b+1,0,9)}chart('a',[{values:policy,color:'#43836b'},{values:baseline,color:'#648eae'}],-6000,2000,'控制步（每步为一个教学时间单位）','累计净收益 / 无量纲');chart('b',[{values:actions,color:'#43836b'},{values:waterCurve,color:'#c59048'}],0,1.1,'控制步','绿：滑套开度 / 橙：含水代理');metrics([['Q 策略累计收益',total.toFixed(1)],['全开基线收益',totalBase.toFixed(1)],['训练回合','1600'],['平均开度',(actions.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0)/60).toFixed(2)]]);$('explain').textContent='在十档含水状态、三档开度的简化环境中训练表格 Q-learning（1600 回合）。开度影响产液贡献与含水状态上升。训练水代价固定 0.7，第一滑块改变测试水代价，展示目标迁移时的表现；第二滑块模拟状态观测误差。策略训练后固定，与全开策略从相同初始状态比较，各自按动作演化。该例只控制单个等效区段，不模拟多段干扰、真实储层或累计产油体积。';head=['step','state','opening','water_proxy','Q_policy_cumulative_reward','all_open_cumulative_reward'];rows=policy.map((v,i)=>[i,states[i],actions[i],waterCurve[i],v,baseline[i]]);}\n$('details').innerHTML='<table><tr>'+head.map(v=>'<th>'+v+'</th>').join('')+'</tr>'+rows.slice(0,5).map(row=>'<tr>'+row.map(v=>'<td>'+(typeof v==='number'?v.toFixed(3):v)+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</table>';\n}\nfunction flush(){if(frame){cancelAnimationFrame(frame);frame=0}run()}function schedule(){$('pv').value=$('param').value;$('nv').value=(+$('noise').value/100).toFixed(2);if(!frame)frame=requestAnimationFrame(()=>{frame=0;run()})}for(const id of ['param','noise']){$(id).oninput=schedule;$(id).onchange=flush}$('run').onclick=flush;$('new').onclick=()=>{seed+=13;flush()};$('csv').onclick=()=>{if(frame)flush();let q=v=>'\"'+String(v).replace(/\"/g,'\"\"')+'\"',blob=new Blob(['\\ufeff'+[head,...rows].map(row=>row.map(q).join(',')).join('\\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),u=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=u;a.download='completion-'+TYPE+'-'+seed+'.csv';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(u),1000)};\n\nlet selected=0;const rawRun=run;run=function(){rawRun();inspect();diagnostic();$('coeff').textContent=TYPE==='select'?'80条带H编号的独立合成历史案例；每方案按输入距离检索3条，再叠加防砂规则。':TYPE==='valve'?'实际Q表（行=含水状态0至9，列=开度1/0.6/0.2）：'+JSON.stringify(model):'实际学习系数：'+JSON.stringify(model)};\nfunction inspect(){selected=Math.max(0,Math.min(rows.length-1,selected));$('point').max=rows.length-1;$('point').value=selected;$('position').textContent='序号 '+selected;let row=rows[selected];$('point-values').innerHTML=head.map((k,j)=>'<div><span>'+k+'</span><b>'+(typeof row[j]==='number'?row[j].toFixed(4):row[j])+'</b></div>').join('');$('point-explain').textContent=SPEC.inspect;}\nfunction diagnostic(){let a=rows.map((r,i)=>TYPE==='select'?r[1]:TYPE==='perforate'?Math.max(0,r[4]-+$('param').value):TYPE==='stress'?r[2]-r[1]:r[4]-r[5]),max=Math.max(.001,...a.map(Math.abs)),label=TYPE==='select'?'各完井方案最终教学评分（高分优先，不是收益金额）':TYPE==='perforate'?'各候选超出出砂代价上限的缺口（0为满足代价约束）':TYPE==='stress'?'逐工况预测载荷−合成真值 / MPa':'Q策略−全开基线的累计收益差 / 无量纲';$('diagnostic').innerHTML='<text x=\"35\" y=\"16\" fill=\"#79828a\" font-size=\"11\">'+label+'</text><path d=\"M35 85H685\" stroke=\"#ded9cc\"/>'+a.map((v,i)=>'<rect x=\"'+(35+i/a.length*650)+'\" y=\"'+(v>=0?85-v/max*55:85)+'\" width=\"'+Math.max(1,650/a.length-3)+'\" height=\"'+Math.max(.6,Math.abs(v)/max*55)+'\" fill=\"'+(v>=0?'#2f7d6b':'#b26a39')+'\"/>').join('');}\n$('point').addEventListener('input',()=>{selected=+$('point').value;inspect()});$('a').addEventListener('click',ev=>{let r=$('a').getBoundingClientRect(),x=(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width*640;selected=Math.round(Math.max(0,Math.min(1,(x-55)/560))*(rows.length-1));inspect()});$('reset').onclick=()=>{seed=91;$('param').value=SPEC.value;$('noise').value=20;selected=0;flush()};\n\nrun();\n\nfunction drawPareto(all,front,best,limit){let g=$('b').getContext('2d');g.clearRect(0,0,640,340);g.font='12px sans-serif';const px=v=>55+v/70*550,py=v=>285-(v-30)/90*240;g.strokeStyle='#d5dfd3';for(let i=0;i<5;i++){g.beginPath();g.moveTo(55,45+i*60);g.lineTo(610,45+i*60);g.stroke();g.fillStyle='#345647';g.fillText(120-i*22.5,5,45+i*60)}g.strokeStyle='#c59048';g.beginPath();g.moveTo(px(limit),35);g.lineTo(px(limit),290);g.stroke();for(let a of all){g.fillStyle=a===best?'#c59048':front.includes(a)?'#43836b':'#aeb8af';let size=a===best?9:front.includes(a)?6:4;g.fillRect(px(a.risk)-size/2,py(a.production)-size/2,size,size)}g.fillStyle='#345647';g.fillText('产能指数 ↑；绿：帕累托 / 灰：被支配 / 橙：选择与上限',25,20);g.fillText('横轴：出砂代价指数 0 → 70（橙线为允许上限）',100,325)}\r\n\n})();","mime":"text/javascript"}];c.tabs.demo={label:"可运行示范",mount(root){let h=CaseDemoHost.create(root,{files,demo},{scene:ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId],kase:c});return ()=>h.destroy()}};Cases.register(c);ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].demo=true;}
{const c={"id":"completion-valve-v22","sceneId":"co4","title":"智能完井滑套控制策略：交互式学习实验","status":"ready","version":"2.2.0","updated":"2026-11-02","tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","lede":"智能完井可调整分段流入通道开度，在有效产液与出水之间进行权衡。控制影响未来状态，因此当前全开不一定获得最佳累计收益。","judge":[{"label":"方法","value":"表格 Q-learning 控制","desc":"纯前端实际计算"},{"label":"数据","value":"教学合成","desc":"独立训练与测试"},{"label":"输出","value":"开度策略、累计收益和含水轨迹","desc":"可视化与 CSV"},{"label":"范围","value":"教学演示","desc":"只控制单个等效区段，不模拟多段耦合或真实储层；累计收益不是累计产油量。"}],"sections":[{"no":1,"en":"CONCEPT","title":"专业概念与背景","html":"<figure style=\"margin:0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 180\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"完井专业概念\"><g font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#345647\"><text x=\"20\" y=\"45\">含水状态 s</text><text x=\"230\" y=\"45\">学习的 Q(s,a)</text><text x=\"490\" y=\"45\">开度动作 a</text><text x=\"230\" y=\"130\">奖励与新状态 → 下一步决策</text></g><path d=\"M145 40H220M390 40H480M560 60V100H180V60\" stroke=\"#43836b\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\"/></svg><figcaption>原理示意，不代表现场结构、产能或力学验算。</figcaption></figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"智能完井滑套控制策略概念\"><rect width=\"760\" height=\"170\" fill=\"#eef4e9\"/><path d=\"M20 130L60 120L100 125L140 60L180 65L220 80L260 40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#43836b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#345648\">智能完井滑套控制策略</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"155\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#345648\">状态观测 → Q 值决策 → 动作 → 状态更新</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#345648\">储层 / 温压 / 生产状态 → 建模与决策 → 可复核候选</text></svg><p>概念示意，非现场曲线。具体坐标和单位见案例演示。</p><p>智能完井可调整分段流入通道开度，在有效产液与出水之间进行权衡。控制影响未来状态，因此当前全开不一定获得最佳累计收益。</p>"},{"no":2,"en":"AI","title":"方法与介入点","html":"<p>输入：十档含水状态、三档开度、简化环境奖励。方法：表格 Q-learning 控制。输出：开度策略、累计收益和含水轨迹。</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px\"><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>01</b><p>定义环境与奖励</p><small>输入与标签</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>02</b><p>1600 回合训练 Q 表</p><small>模型与特征</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>03</b><p>独立测试固定策略</p><small>预测与决策</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>04</b><p>对比长期全开基线</p><small>误差与来源</small></div></div><p>状态观测 → Q 值决策 → 动作 → 状态更新。</p>"},{"no":3,"en":"DATA","title":"数据要求与验证","html":"<p>真实应用需要同井段配对的十档含水状态、三档开度、简化环境奖励，并由施工结果、胶结解释或独立验证资料提供标签。先做小规模概念验证，再按井、样品或连续时间块留出测试，避免相邻样本泄漏。</p><p>本演示训练种子 17、测试初始种子 91；代理从独立合成样本拟合；优选采用案例推理与规则；滑套采用表格强化学习。所有样本均为教学合成。</p>"},{"no":4,"en":"LIMIT","title":"局限与参考","html":"<p>只控制单个等效区段，不模拟多段耦合或真实储层；累计收益不是累计产油量。</p><p><a href=\"https://glossary.slb.com/en/terms/c/completion_bond_log\">SLB：防砂完井概念</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.neighbors.NearestCentroid.html\">最近类中心原理</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/linear_model.html\">回归与逻辑回归原理</a>。合成公式与示范为本项目独立教学实现。</p>"}]},"workflow":{"label":"案例流程","title":"智能完井滑套控制策略：输入到验收","lead":["每一步均对应演示里的计算或证据。调节滑块观察成像、噪声、平滑或审核阈值的影响。"],"stats":[["运行","浏览器"],["数据","合成"],["输出","可导出"]],"steps":[{"name":"01 定义环境与奖励","role":"数据","do":"十档含水状态、三档开度、简化环境奖励按深度对齐，按独立井留出测试。","effect":"规范输入及标签","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"02 1600 回合训练 Q 表","role":"学习","do":"按各例方法建立案例检索、回归代理或 Q 表；不使用测试标签拟合。","effect":"可复用的训练模型","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"03 独立测试固定策略","role":"推理","do":"状态观测 → Q 值决策 → 动作 → 状态更新；第一滑块调节当前实验参数。","effect":"可视预测与候选","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"04 对比长期全开基线","role":"验收","do":"比较真值与基线，导出 CSV 并复核误差。","effect":"基线比较或来源审核","trap":"只控制单个等效区段，不模拟多段耦合或真实储层；累计收益不是累计产油量。"}],"metrics":{"title":"步骤映射与评价口径","html":"<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px\"><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>01</b><p>定义环境与奖励</p><small>输入与标签</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>02</b><p>1600 回合训练 Q 表</p><small>模型与特征</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>03</b><p>独立测试固定策略</p><small>预测与决策</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>04</b><p>对比长期全开基线</p><small>误差与来源</small></div></div><p>分类准确率 = 正确数 / 测试数；F1 = 2TP/(2TP+FP+FN)。层界按 ±2 m 一对一匹配；报告引用覆盖率仅表示有来源，不等于语义正确率。后验分数未经校准。</p><p>累计净收益为每步油贡献减去水代价之和；与全开基线分别按自身动作演化。</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 105\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"数据到决策与验收\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">独立资料</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"192\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">学习模型</text><rect x=\"360\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">候选 / 预测</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"552\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">误差与约束复核</text></svg>"},"fails":[{"name":"采集与工况变化","why":"井况、浆体与地层压力变化可影响结果。"},{"name":"标签与对齐","why":"深度归位、采样尺度与人工解释歧义可能影响真值。"},{"name":"边界","why":"只控制单个等效区段，不模拟多段耦合或真实储层；累计收益不是累计产油量。"}]},"demo":{"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850}}},demo={"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850},files=[{"name":"demo/index.html","size":2980,"enc":"text","data":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>智能完井滑套控制策略</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"demo.css\"></head><body><div class=\"panel\"><header class=\"demo-head\"><div><span class=\"kicker\">独立合成测试井 · 种子 <span id=\"seed\"></span></span><h1>智能完井滑套控制策略</h1><p class=\"lead\">智能完井可调整分段流入通道开度，在有效产液与出水之间进行权衡。控制影响未来状态，因此当前全开不一定获得最佳累计收益。</p></div><button id=\"new\" class=\"btn primary\">换一口井 ↻</button></header><div class=\"demo-controls\"><div class=\"ctl\"><label>测试水处理代价 ×100 <output id=\"pv\"></output></label><input id=\"param\" aria-label=\"测试水处理代价 ×100\" type=\"range\" min=\"10\" max=\"100\" value=\"70\" step=\"1\"></div><div class=\"ctl\"><label>状态观测误差 <output id=\"nv\"></output></label><input id=\"noise\" aria-label=\"噪声\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"20\"></div></div><div class=\"demo-body\"><section class=\"demo-charts charts\"><div class=\"legend\">橙：阈值/真值/推荐；绿：学习/策略；蓝：基线。各图按标注单位读取。</div><figure><figcaption>Q策略和全开基线的累计奖励</figcaption><canvas id=\"a\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"Q策略和全开基线的累计奖励\"></canvas></figure><figure><figcaption>策略开度与含水状态的动态轨迹</figcaption><canvas id=\"b\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"策略开度与含水状态的动态轨迹\"></canvas></figure><svg id=\"diagnostic\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"逐点误差分析\"></svg></section><aside class=\"demo-results\"><div id=\"metrics\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><p class=\"note\" id=\"explain\"></p><section class=\"inspect\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>逐点核对：计算结果与依据</h2><span id=\"position\"></span></div><label class=\"point-control\">选择位置<input id=\"point\" aria-label=\"核对位置\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"89\" value=\"25\"></label><div id=\"point-values\" class=\"point-values\"></div><p id=\"point-explain\"></p></section><details><summary>展开模型系数与结果明细</summary><pre id=\"report\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:12px/1.9 sans-serif;max-height:280px;overflow:auto;background:#f8f6ef;padding:10px\"></pre><p>表格 Q-learning 控制；训练/优化依据见实际模型明细，换井不重新训练。</p><p id=\"coeff\" class=\"coeff\"></p><div id=\"details\"></div></details><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"run\">重新计算</button><button id=\"reset\">恢复默认</button><button id=\"csv\">导出本次 CSV</button></div><p class=\"note\">只控制单个等效区段，不模拟多段耦合或真实储层；累计收益不是累计产油量。 全部数据为合成教学资料，结果需要独立井验证和人工复核。</p></aside></div></div><script src=\"demo.js\"></script></body></html>","mime":"text/html"},{"name":"demo/demo.css","size":7919,"enc":"text","data":"/* 示范页样式。运行在沙箱 iframe 里，随便写，不影响主站。 */\n:root{\n  --ink:#242b2e; --ink-2:#4d565b; --ink-3:#79828a;\n  --line:#e9e4d8; --jade:#2f7d6b; --jade-l:#e6f1ec;\n  --clay:#b26a39; --paper:#fbfaf6;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{\n  margin:0;padding:18px 20px 24px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:\"Inter\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;\n}\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}\nh1{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.78}\n.ctl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:9px}\n.ctl label{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-width:170px}\n.ctl output{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}\n.ctl input[type=range]{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade);height:18px}\nsvg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff}\n#ratio{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}\n.readouts{\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;\n  background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\n  margin-top:12px;\n}\n.ro{background:#fff;padding:9px 12px}\n.ro .k{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.06em}\n.ro b{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.ro b.ok{color:var(--jade)}\n.ro b.bad{color:var(--clay)}\n.note{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);line-height:1.75}\n.note b{color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* 保持样例底色、字号、控件和读数样式；增加逐点解释。 */\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:10.5px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--ink-2)}.dot:before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:5px}.truth:before{background:#2f7d6b}.model:before{background:#b26a39}.base:before{background:#41699b}.mud{background:#f4f7eb;padding:0 4px}#porosity,#residual{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}.inspect,details{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.section-head span{font-family:monospace;color:var(--jade)}.point-control{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:10px 0;font-size:12px}.point-control input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade)}.point-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.point-values div{padding:8px;background:#fff}.point-values span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}.point-values b{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace}#point-explain{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}details{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.actions button{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:5px;font:12px inherit;color:var(--jade);cursor:pointer}.actions span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:12px}.ctl{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px}.ctl label{min-width:100%}.readouts,.point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.section-head{display:block}}\n\n/* 与老师 welllog-layer 样例一致：标题说明右侧、参数条上方。 */\n.demo-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#f6f5ee}.demo-head>div{flex:1;min-width:220px}.demo-head .lead{margin-bottom:0}.kicker{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--jade)}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:7px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.btn.primary{background:var(--jade);border-color:var(--jade);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.btn.primary:hover{background:#256554;border-color:#256554}.btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--clay);outline-offset:3px}\n\n/* v2.2: fill the portal's full content width; match the reference's header/body structure. */\nbody{padding:0;background:var(--paper)}\n.panel{width:100%;max-width:none;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}\n.demo-head{margin:0;padding:14px 18px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;background:#fcfbf8;gap:18px}\n.demo-head>div{min-width:220px;flex:1}.demo-head h1{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px}.demo-head .lead{max-width:86ch;font-size:11.8px;line-height:1.7}\n.demo-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:14px 24px;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8f6f0}\n.demo-controls .ctl{flex:0 1 340px;margin:0;gap:12px;min-width:250px}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:135px;font-size:11.5px}.demo-controls .ctl input{min-width:90px;width:150px}\n.demo-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(320px,.9fr);align-items:start}\n.demo-charts{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}\n.demo-results{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px}.demo-charts .legend{margin:0 0 9px;gap:8px 12px}\n.demo-charts svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.demo-results .readouts{margin-top:0;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.demo-results .ro{padding:10px 12px}.demo-results .ro b{font-size:14px}.demo-results .note{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.8}\n.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values div{padding:9px 10px}\n.demo-results .section-head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.demo-results .section-head h2{font-size:12.5px}.demo-results .actions{gap:8px}.demo-results .actions span{flex-basis:100%}\n.demo-results .actions button{font-family:inherit;font-size:12px}.demo-results details{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.demo-results table{table-layout:fixed}button,input{touch-action:manipulation}\n@media(max-width:960px){.demo-body{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.demo-charts{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.demo-results .readouts{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:0}.panel{border-radius:9px}.demo-head,.demo-controls,.demo-charts,.demo-results{padding:12px}.demo-controls{gap:10px}.demo-controls .ctl{flex:1 1 100%;min-width:0;flex-wrap:nowrap}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:130px}.demo-results .readouts,.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-head h1{font-size:16px}.demo-head .btn{margin-left:auto}}\n\n.charts figure{margin:0 0 12px}.charts figcaption{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:6px}.charts canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;cursor:crosshair}#metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--line)}#metrics div{background:white;padding:10px}#metrics span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}#metrics strong{font:14px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--jade)}#details{overflow:auto}#details table{table-layout:auto;font-size:10px}.point-values b{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.point-values div{min-width:0}#diagnostic{margin-top:10px}.coeff{font-size:11px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}","mime":"text/css"},{"name":"demo/demo.js","size":14174,"enc":"text","data":"(function(){const TYPE=\"valve\",SPEC={\"unit\":\"\",\"value\":70,\"inspect\":\"状态0至9，开度为1/0.6/0.2，收益是环境奖励累计而非产油体积。固定训练Q表，测试改变水代价和观测误差；两策略从同一状态出发各自演化。\",\"classes\":[\"详见图内单位和说明\"]};\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id),clamp=(v,a,b)=>Math.max(a,Math.min(b,v));function rng(s){return()=>{s=(Math.imul(1664525,s)+1013904223)>>>0;return s/4294967296}}\nlet seed=91,rows=[],head=[],frame=0;\nfunction fit(data){let n=data[0].x.length,A=Array.from({length:n},()=>Array(n+1).fill(0));for(const {x,y} of data)for(let i=0;i<n;i++){for(let j=0;j<n;j++)A[i][j]+=x[i]*x[j];A[i][n]+=x[i]*y}for(let i=1;i<n;i++)A[i][i]+=.01;for(let i=0;i<n;i++){let p=i;for(let j=i+1;j<n;j++)if(Math.abs(A[j][i])>Math.abs(A[p][i]))p=j;[A[i],A[p]]=[A[p],A[i]];let v=A[i][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[i][j]/=v;for(let z=0;z<n;z++)if(z!==i){let q=A[z][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[z][j]-=q*A[i][j]}}return A.map(row=>row[n])}\nconst predict=(w,x)=>w.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+v*x[i],0),mae=(a,b)=>a.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-b[i]),0)/a.length;\nfunction chart(id,series,min,max,xlabel,ylabel,bands=[]){let c=$(id),g=c.getContext('2d'),w=640,h=340;g.clearRect(0,0,w,h);const px=i=>55+i/Math.max(1,series[0].values.length-1)*560,py=v=>285-(v-min)/(max-min)*240;\n bands.forEach(b=>{g.fillStyle=b.color;g.fillRect(px(b.start),45,px(b.end)-px(b.start),240)});\n g.font='12px sans-serif';g.lineWidth=1;for(let i=0;i<=4;i++){let v=min+(max-min)*i/4,y=py(v);g.strokeStyle='#dce5df';g.beginPath();g.moveTo(55,y);g.lineTo(615,y);g.stroke();g.fillStyle='#4b6259';g.fillText(v.toFixed(max-min<1?2:max<=3?1:0),4,y+4)}g.fillText(ylabel,55,22);g.fillText(xlabel,215,333);for(let i=0;i<=4;i++)g.fillText(Math.round(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4),px(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4)-5,306);\n series.forEach(s=>{g.strokeStyle=s.color;g.lineWidth=2;g.beginPath();s.values.forEach((v,i)=>{i?g.lineTo(px(i),py(v)):g.moveTo(px(i),py(v))});g.stroke()});}\nconst model=(()=>{let r=rng(17),data=[];if(TYPE==='select'){return Array.from({length:80},(_,i)=>{let sand=r(),water=r(),method=i%4;return {id:'H'+String(i+1).padStart(3,'0'),x:[sand,water],method,y:85-25*sand*(1-[.05,.15,.65,.9][method])-12*water-8*method+(r()-.5)*4}})}if(TYPE==='valve'){let q=Array.from({length:10},()=>[0,0,0]);for(let episode=0;episode<1600;episode++){let state=Math.floor(r()*9);for(let t=0;t<20;t++){let action=r()<.2?Math.floor(r()*3):q[state].indexOf(Math.max(...q[state])),water=state/9,open=[1,.6,.2][action],reward=100*open*(1-water)-100*open*water*.7,next=clamp(state+(action===0?1:action===1?(r()<.5?1:0):0),0,9);q[state][action]+=.15*(reward+.92*Math.max(...q[next])-q[state][action]);state=next}}return q}let a=[],b=[];for(let i=0;i<500;i++){let x=r(),y=r(),z=r(),features=TYPE==='perforate'?[1,x,y,z,x*y]:[1,x,y,x*y];a.push({x:features,y:TYPE==='perforate'?40+30*x+20*y+8*z+10*x*y:60+110*x+70*y+25*x*y});if(TYPE==='perforate')b.push({x:features,y:5+20*x+12*y+4*z+6*x*y})}return {primary:fit(a),risk:b.length?fit(b):null}})();\nfunction metrics(a){$('metrics').innerHTML=a.map(([a,b])=>'<div><span>'+a+'</span><strong>'+b+'</strong></div>').join('')}\nfunction run(){let p=+$('param').value,noise=+$('noise').value/100,r=rng(seed);$('pv').value=p;$('nv').value=noise.toFixed(2);$('seed').textContent=seed;$('report').textContent='';rows=[];\nif(TYPE==='select'){let sand=p/100,water=clamp(noise+((seed-91)%17)*.015,0,1),names=['裸眼','套管射孔','筛管','砾石充填'],scores=[],support=[];for(let m=0;m<4;m++){let near=model.filter(d=>d.method===m).map(d=>({...d,dist:(d.x[0]-sand)**2+(d.x[1]-water)**2})).sort((a,b)=>a.dist-b.dist).slice(0,3),estimate=near.reduce((s,d)=>s+d.y,0)/3,penalty=35*sand*(1-[.05,.15,.65,.9][m]),score=estimate-penalty;scores.push(score);support.push(near.map(d=>d.id).join('/'))}let best=scores.indexOf(Math.max(...scores));chart('a',[{values:scores,color:'#43836b'}],0,100,'方案编号 0裸眼 / 1射孔 / 2筛管 / 3砾石充填','相似案例效益 − 出砂惩罚 / 教学分数');chart('b',[{values:[sand,water],color:'#c59048'}],0,1,'特征编号 0出砂倾向 / 1出水代理','输入特征（0–1）');metrics([['候选首位',names[best]],['最高教学评分',scores[best].toFixed(1)],['历史合成案例','80 条'],['每方案引用','3 条近邻']]);$('explain').textContent='以出砂和出水代理的欧氏距离检索每种方式最近的三个历史合成案例，均值效益减去手工知识规则的防砂不足惩罚后排序。该实现为案例推理与规则融合，不是训练好的知识图谱或产能模型。第一滑块为出砂倾向，第二滑块为出水基础代理；换井叠加固定井间差异，实际值见右图。评分无货币单位，不等于真实收益，不能据此直接选现场方案。';$('report').textContent=names.map((n,i)=>n+'：引用 '+support[i]+'，评分 '+scores[i].toFixed(2)).join('\\n');head=['method','score','source_case_ids'];rows=names.map((v,i)=>[v,scores[i],support[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='perforate'){let candidates=[];for(let density of [8,12,16,20])for(let depth of [.2,.4,.6,.8])for(let phase of [60,90,120]){let x=(density-8)/12,y=(depth-.2)/.6,z=(phase-60)/60,features=[1,x,y,z,x*y],production=predict(model.primary,features),risk=predict(model.risk,features)+noise*8+((seed-91)%17)*.12;candidates.push({density,depth,phase,production,risk})}let front=candidates.filter(a=>!candidates.some(b=>b.production>=a.production&&b.risk<=a.risk&&(b.production>a.production||b.risk<a.risk))),feasible=front.filter(c=>c.risk<=p),best=feasible.sort((a,b)=>b.production-a.production)[0];chart('a',[{values:candidates.map(c=>c.production),color:'#43836b'}],30,120,'候选组合编号（48 组）','预测产能指数 / 无量纲');chart('b',[{values:candidates.map(c=>c.risk),color:'#43836b'},{values:candidates.map(()=>p),color:'#c59048'}],0,70,'候选组合编号','出砂代价指数 / 教学分数');drawPareto(candidates,front,best,p);metrics([['帕累托候选',front.length+' / 48'],['约束内前沿点',feasible.length],['推荐孔密',best?best.density+' 孔/m':'无可行方案'],['推荐穿深 / 相位',best?best.depth+' m / '+best.phase+'°':'—']]);$('explain').textContent='500 个独立合成训练组合分别拟合产能和出砂代价代理；枚举孔密、穿深、相位共 48 组，剔除被其他方案同时“更高产能、更低代价”支配的点，形成帕累托前沿。第一滑块为允许代价上限，第二滑块增加代价裕度，换井叠加固定的井间代价差异。前沿内筛选最高预测产能，无可行点时返回无解。代价不是概率；未做射孔弹、岩石力学或真实产能计算。';$('report').textContent='帕累托前沿组合：\\n'+front.map(c=>c.density+'孔/m，'+c.depth+'m，'+c.phase+'°，产能指数'+c.production.toFixed(1)+'，代价'+c.risk.toFixed(1)).join('\\n');head=['density_shots_m','penetration_m','phase_deg','productivity_index','sand_cost_index','pareto','selected'];rows=candidates.map(c=>[c.density,c.depth,c.phase,c.production,c.risk,front.includes(c)?1:0,c===best?1:0]);}\nif(TYPE==='stress'){let truth=[],pred=[],base=[],factors=[];for(let i=0;i<100;i++){let t=p/100,pressure=.5+.4*Math.sin((i+seed%19)/16),y=60+110*t+70*pressure+25*t*pressure,observed=clamp(t+(r()-.5)*noise,0,1);truth.push(y);pred.push(predict(model.primary,[1,observed,pressure,observed*pressure]));base.push(180);factors.push(300/Math.max(1,pred[i]))}chart('a',[{values:truth,color:'#c59048'},{values:pred,color:'#43836b'},{values:base,color:'#648eae'}],0,300,'工况组合序号（压力代理随序号变化）','等效载荷代理 / MPa');chart('b',[{values:factors,color:'#43836b'},{values:factors.map(()=>1.5),color:'#c59048'}],0,6,'工况组合序号','教学强度限值 / 预测载荷');metrics([['预测 MAE',(pred.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-truth[i]),0)/100).toFixed(2)+' MPa'],['固定基线 MAE',(base.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-truth[i]),0)/100).toFixed(2)+' MPa'],['最小代理安全系数',Math.min(...factors).toFixed(2)],['低于教学目标工况',factors.filter(v=>v<1.5).length+' / 100']]);$('explain').textContent='500 个合成温压工况训练含交互项的岭回归，预测等效载荷代理。第一滑块为归一化温差×100，第二滑块为温度观测噪声。橙：真值；绿：代理；蓝：固定 180 MPa。300 MPa 强度和 1.5 目标均为教学假设，不对应钢级规范；未实现轴力、弯曲、屈曲、接头泄漏或疲劳验算。';head=['scenario','truth_load_MPa','predicted_load_MPa','fixed_load_MPa','proxy_safety_factor'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,v,pred[i],base[i],factors[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='valve'){let policy=[],baseline=[],waterCurve=[],states=[],actions=[],s=1+seed%3,b=1+seed%3,total=0,totalBase=0;for(let t=0;t<60;t++){let sensed=clamp(Math.round(s+(r()-.5)*noise*4),0,9),cost=p/100,a=model[sensed].indexOf(Math.max(...model[sensed])),op=[1,.6,.2][a],w=s/9,wb=b/9,reward=100*op*(1-w)-100*op*w*cost,rb=100*(1-wb)-100*wb*cost;total+=reward;totalBase+=rb;policy.push(total);baseline.push(totalBase);waterCurve.push(w);states.push(s);actions.push(op);s=clamp(s+(a===0?1:a===1?(r()<.5?1:0):0),0,9);b=clamp(b+1,0,9)}chart('a',[{values:policy,color:'#43836b'},{values:baseline,color:'#648eae'}],-6000,2000,'控制步（每步为一个教学时间单位）','累计净收益 / 无量纲');chart('b',[{values:actions,color:'#43836b'},{values:waterCurve,color:'#c59048'}],0,1.1,'控制步','绿：滑套开度 / 橙：含水代理');metrics([['Q 策略累计收益',total.toFixed(1)],['全开基线收益',totalBase.toFixed(1)],['训练回合','1600'],['平均开度',(actions.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0)/60).toFixed(2)]]);$('explain').textContent='在十档含水状态、三档开度的简化环境中训练表格 Q-learning（1600 回合）。开度影响产液贡献与含水状态上升。训练水代价固定 0.7，第一滑块改变测试水代价，展示目标迁移时的表现；第二滑块模拟状态观测误差。策略训练后固定，与全开策略从相同初始状态比较，各自按动作演化。该例只控制单个等效区段，不模拟多段干扰、真实储层或累计产油体积。';head=['step','state','opening','water_proxy','Q_policy_cumulative_reward','all_open_cumulative_reward'];rows=policy.map((v,i)=>[i,states[i],actions[i],waterCurve[i],v,baseline[i]]);}\n$('details').innerHTML='<table><tr>'+head.map(v=>'<th>'+v+'</th>').join('')+'</tr>'+rows.slice(0,5).map(row=>'<tr>'+row.map(v=>'<td>'+(typeof v==='number'?v.toFixed(3):v)+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</table>';\n}\nfunction flush(){if(frame){cancelAnimationFrame(frame);frame=0}run()}function schedule(){$('pv').value=$('param').value;$('nv').value=(+$('noise').value/100).toFixed(2);if(!frame)frame=requestAnimationFrame(()=>{frame=0;run()})}for(const id of ['param','noise']){$(id).oninput=schedule;$(id).onchange=flush}$('run').onclick=flush;$('new').onclick=()=>{seed+=13;flush()};$('csv').onclick=()=>{if(frame)flush();let q=v=>'\"'+String(v).replace(/\"/g,'\"\"')+'\"',blob=new Blob(['\\ufeff'+[head,...rows].map(row=>row.map(q).join(',')).join('\\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),u=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=u;a.download='completion-'+TYPE+'-'+seed+'.csv';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(u),1000)};\n\nlet selected=0;const rawRun=run;run=function(){rawRun();inspect();diagnostic();$('coeff').textContent=TYPE==='select'?'80条带H编号的独立合成历史案例；每方案按输入距离检索3条，再叠加防砂规则。':TYPE==='valve'?'实际Q表（行=含水状态0至9，列=开度1/0.6/0.2）：'+JSON.stringify(model):'实际学习系数：'+JSON.stringify(model)};\nfunction inspect(){selected=Math.max(0,Math.min(rows.length-1,selected));$('point').max=rows.length-1;$('point').value=selected;$('position').textContent='序号 '+selected;let row=rows[selected];$('point-values').innerHTML=head.map((k,j)=>'<div><span>'+k+'</span><b>'+(typeof row[j]==='number'?row[j].toFixed(4):row[j])+'</b></div>').join('');$('point-explain').textContent=SPEC.inspect;}\nfunction diagnostic(){let a=rows.map((r,i)=>TYPE==='select'?r[1]:TYPE==='perforate'?Math.max(0,r[4]-+$('param').value):TYPE==='stress'?r[2]-r[1]:r[4]-r[5]),max=Math.max(.001,...a.map(Math.abs)),label=TYPE==='select'?'各完井方案最终教学评分（高分优先，不是收益金额）':TYPE==='perforate'?'各候选超出出砂代价上限的缺口（0为满足代价约束）':TYPE==='stress'?'逐工况预测载荷−合成真值 / MPa':'Q策略−全开基线的累计收益差 / 无量纲';$('diagnostic').innerHTML='<text x=\"35\" y=\"16\" fill=\"#79828a\" font-size=\"11\">'+label+'</text><path d=\"M35 85H685\" stroke=\"#ded9cc\"/>'+a.map((v,i)=>'<rect x=\"'+(35+i/a.length*650)+'\" y=\"'+(v>=0?85-v/max*55:85)+'\" width=\"'+Math.max(1,650/a.length-3)+'\" height=\"'+Math.max(.6,Math.abs(v)/max*55)+'\" fill=\"'+(v>=0?'#2f7d6b':'#b26a39')+'\"/>').join('');}\n$('point').addEventListener('input',()=>{selected=+$('point').value;inspect()});$('a').addEventListener('click',ev=>{let r=$('a').getBoundingClientRect(),x=(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width*640;selected=Math.round(Math.max(0,Math.min(1,(x-55)/560))*(rows.length-1));inspect()});$('reset').onclick=()=>{seed=91;$('param').value=SPEC.value;$('noise').value=20;selected=0;flush()};\n\nrun();\n\nfunction drawPareto(all,front,best,limit){let g=$('b').getContext('2d');g.clearRect(0,0,640,340);g.font='12px sans-serif';const px=v=>55+v/70*550,py=v=>285-(v-30)/90*240;g.strokeStyle='#d5dfd3';for(let i=0;i<5;i++){g.beginPath();g.moveTo(55,45+i*60);g.lineTo(610,45+i*60);g.stroke();g.fillStyle='#345647';g.fillText(120-i*22.5,5,45+i*60)}g.strokeStyle='#c59048';g.beginPath();g.moveTo(px(limit),35);g.lineTo(px(limit),290);g.stroke();for(let a of all){g.fillStyle=a===best?'#c59048':front.includes(a)?'#43836b':'#aeb8af';let size=a===best?9:front.includes(a)?6:4;g.fillRect(px(a.risk)-size/2,py(a.production)-size/2,size,size)}g.fillStyle='#345647';g.fillText('产能指数 ↑；绿：帕累托 / 灰：被支配 / 橙：选择与上限',25,20);g.fillText('横轴：出砂代价指数 0 → 70（橙线为允许上限）',100,325)}\r\n\n})();","mime":"text/javascript"}];c.tabs.demo={label:"可运行示范",mount(root){let h=CaseDemoHost.create(root,{files,demo},{scene:ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId],kase:c});return ()=>h.destroy()}};Cases.register(c);ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].demo=true;}